<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="mt1">Daniel</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow risi Daniel chekhai, now arui khin dow 530 BC khe chekhai. Risi Daniel dow Juda pren kowi Jehoiakim chowm mang mih khin khe kowh krawi tek Thurai lai mih risi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Risi Daniel chabowih kowi arui uowi mih dow pre bak ia changah kown. Lowk kowi dow amatia chownglawng kowi kowh uanla mih lawnguan chekhai, now pre kowi dow pur prakowi nauang chowm mang kown miuüa lawnguan kowi kowh mukmang laiklow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aia chownglawng kowi kowh uanla mih lawnguan dow maiawng: Aia hai aia maru Jihudiuüa mih Babulawn pren kowi cham takhang khai. Nami khin khe aia hai aia auiua sum ia mih dow amatni kowh Thurai ana pek klen kowi mang ana pek khowm chün dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi lusa ripra kramra uowima mih hownia paw Thurai dow amatni kowi lawngah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Now mukmang kowi kowh khiah mih pur prakowi kowh lawnguan dow maiawng: Palusama kowi powng mih mang alowk kung kowi alowk nauang uowi tali ia kown. Naiawngün manguüa dow lainowmma nakür kown, now amatni dow palusama kowi nachang low kown. Tawkche amatni kowh mangra dow nachur kown. Nachenganchepaw amatni kung kowi kowh nauang ta chowm mang lowk ia kown mih dow amatni bowkbowk lak-e nalang kür kown. Aia kowh mangra dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma nauowi kown; katpaw nachur kown nadowi. Nami mang dow Isu Krista chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Chakramang: Chakramang pami lung sowm hown kowh dow Thurai kowi kowh tek mih nadowi. Lung sowm hown kowh ruiah mih chakramang dow manguüa, kim iauüa hai sarauüa kowi kowh hawk uan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Sawnchak: Sawnchak pami dow kowmatia hown ning tale mih hai tale ngia miuüa kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Laipet: Laipet pami dow laiklow lak kowi kowh auan apetma tekah mih chekhai. Laipet laiklow dow auan tukah nak dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Mur: Mur pami dow phalawng lai hown tek pe seal mih chekhai. Alai chowng khe naiawng mih mur mih manguüa kowh rutbüt hown tukah khai. Naiawng tukta mur khowk hanow thawpta mih ari aiang hai lawtta mih ana pek ia klowi dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaah sakowmma Daniel uowi mih 1:1-21</para>
  <para style="io1">Mukmang kowi arup iukma Nebuknezar khi mih 2:1-49</para>
  <para style="io1">Kuh hown Nebuknezar thawp arup mih hai maih khawng 3:1-30</para>
  <para style="io1">Mang lak kowi Nebuknezar khi singh mih lawnguan 4:1-37</para>
  <para style="io1">Belsazar thak pawi mih hai kimbang kowi cha uang tarui mih 5:1-31</para>
  <para style="io1">Mang Darius lawt ana mih hai krangsi puk kowi Daniel 6:1-28</para>
  <para style="io1">Kaurawng uaramchak tali klüng mih lawnguan kowi Daniel khi mang mih 7:1-28</para>
  <para style="io1">Ruapurla hai ruala lawnguan kowi Daniel khi mukmang mih 8:1-27</para>
  <para style="io1">70 sapta lawnguan kowi Daniel khi mukmang mih 9:1-27</para>
  <para style="io1">Thurai kraingra mukmang 10:1-21</para>
  <para style="io1">Alenma nauang tachi kown mih risi lai phuang 11:1-35</para>
  <para style="io1">Akrama kung kowi nauang tachi kown mih risi lai phuang 11:36-12:13</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="s">Daniel kowi Babulawn pren kowi pawla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />Juda pren mang Jehoiakim chowm mang mih sum ning khe Babulawn pren mang Nebuknezar mih Jerusalem marow kowi uangah hanow uang rumah khai. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG mih Juda pren mang Jehoiakim kowi Nebuknezar rut kowi ap-ah khai, now Thurai chup kim kowi kowh puh bia aikam ün paw apla ne khai. Nahanow Nebuknezar dow naiawngün uanh Babulawn pren kowi pawla hanow aia kowh thuraiuüa chup kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan nungra rum kowi kowtowah khai.<verse eid="DAN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" />Akat khe Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh mang chuprek chaprekuüa hai maru iuk chauüa hownia nauang pawla klanguüa ne kownkow mang Nebuknezar mih aia kowh aluchow Aspenaz kowi peah ana khai. Aspenaz dow <char style="w">akletia</char> chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />Mang kim kowi kowh nachang lup kown mih naiawngün klanguüa hawmh dow aser auowk uowi dowi mih, klangiungma mih, chanlaima mih, prengia uowima mih hai ngeng chakma mih naown kown takla. Now naiawngün klanguüa hawmh kowi nasangah Babulawn prenchak lai hai nasangah cha kownkow Aspenaz kowi peah ana khai. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Now mang dow aia kowh chakkham hownia ni towng kowh lakke mowr chi chakkham hai grep tui napeah kownkow pe ana khai. Naiawng hai amatni kowi dow sum ning mowr natüngsangah kown, now nami kung kowi chiang mang kowh lup nape changah kown.<verse eid="DAN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />Naiawngünuüa pungmadawng kowi Juda krungchak hownia kowh Daniel, Hanania, Misael hai Azaria büah paw tawi uowi khai. <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" />Now aluchow Aspenaz mih amatni kowi Babulawn prenchak lai hown maiawng plan rük pe ming sar khai: Daniel kowi dow Beltesazar, Hanani kowi dow Sadrak, Misael kowi dow Mesak, now Azari kowi dow Abednago pahai rük pe khai.<verse eid="DAN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaah sakowmma Daniel uowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />Nachenganchepaw Daniel dow mang kowh chakkham hai grep tui hown natasür talawk dowi kownkow tatuak hüah khai. Now naiawngün chakkham hown natasür talawk dowi kownkow aia dow aluchow Aspenaz tut-e kowlü ana khai. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" />Nahanow Daniel kowi nasaksing sanaah kownkow hai nasakrauah kownkow Thurai mih aluchow Aspenaz kowi peah saktuak khai. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />Tawkche nami aluchow tek pe Daniel mih, “Enni kowh chakkham hai grep tui khowm bowk mih mang ang kowh chakramang kowi ang kram chekhai. Ang kowh chakramang dow enni sawnchakuüa lak-e enni lang kow nga kown mih nau dowi chekhai. Enni che kow nga hanow aia dow nadungta ang ngawng kown chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Now Daniel, Hanania, Misael hai Azaria büah kowi nakhetah kownkow aluchow Aspenaz khowm bowkah mih maru kowi Daniel tek pe mih, <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" />“Sakrauma hown hamüt ni mowr chaing anging diah; anging nacha nakhamah kownkow pramna hai tui krowngchow pe anging now na taih. <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />Nami kung kowi mang kowh chakkham iung cha miuüa hown tuh anging diah, now en khi-ah mih powm iawng en naruüa anging luk kowi chang diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="DAN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />Nahanow nami khetah miia dow naiawng nachang kown mih nauta khai, now amatni kowi dow hamüt ni mowr chaingah khai.<verse eid="DAN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />Now hamüt ni kung kowi dow mang kowh chakkham cha mih klanguüa hawmh lak-e amatni lang klangiung hai lang kow iung mih khi khai. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />Naiawng rakowi mingkhetah miia dow amatni kowi mang chakkham pe chaah dowi bowt chekhai. Nami takcha kowi amatni kowi pramna hing pe chata hüah khai. <verse eid="DAN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />Now nami klanguüa hawmh tali ia kowi dow cha tukra, chürra hai chanlaira maten Thurai peah khai. Daniel dow mukmang hai mang kowi kowh khi-ah mih auan maten nowngia tuk chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniel büah kowi mang tut-e kowpawla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />Mang khowm bowkta mih akhin uang talen khe dow aluchow Aspenaz mih naiawngün klanguüa hawmh kowi mang Nebuknezar pur kowi kowpawla khai bowt. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Naiawngün klanguüa hawmh hown taklowp taklang hanow mang dow Daniel, Hanania, Misael hai Azaria büah kowi miapaw nowng prem dowi pami tuk khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow kowbüah tali ia kowi pe changah mang lup khai bowt. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" />Amatni kowi dow chanlaira hai prengia lawnguan maten mang mih lüntaah khai. Now aia pren maten kowi kowh <char style="w">maiaklese sara</char> hai süngnam tawn uowi miuüa lak-e hamüt dungna lang tuk pami tuk khai.<verse eid="DAN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" />Daniel dow Persia pren mang Kuras uown chowm mang mih paning mowr Babulawn pren mang lup tawi chang khai.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s">Nebuknezar khi mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />Nebuknezar dow aia chowm mang mih pre ning khe khi mang lowk khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow lainowmma saktuak pusa khai, now müi paw aia tamüi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" />Aia dow aia khi-ah mih mang uan nape phuangah kownkow maiaklese sarauüa, süngnam tawn miuüa, krimarang sarauüa hai hawra sarauüa kowi nakrawi haw kownkow chin maru khai. Naiawngün sarauüa dow uang towm hanow mang pur kowi uang iowng khai. <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi mang tek pe mih, “Ang khi mang lowk mih auan natukla kownkow lainowmma ang saktuak pusa khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" />Nakhowk khe Aramaik lai hown amatni tek pe mang mih, “Aw mangkri, chowngdawng sakklangma en pacham sing lah. En khi-ah mih mang dow en naruüa kowi lawp pe diah. Nami mang uan dow anging naphuang en kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" />Nakhowk khe amatni kowi mang klangah mih, “Mang kowi tawng chow ang khi mih hai nami mang uan tawng chow mih enni che ia phuang ang dowi hanow ang natawpta enni naknak kown, now enni kowh kim üa paw mawngchawng kuakra ang nachangta enni kown. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" />Nachenganchepaw ang khi-ah mih mang hai auan che enni ia phuang ang khai hanow awmrawm sung hai ringkawra iukma enni naka kown. Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih nami mang hai auan tek ang büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />Nakhowk khe amatni klangah mih, “Mangkri, en khi-ah mih mang dow en naruüa kowi phat pe diah. Nami mang uan dow anging naphuang en kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />Now mang tek pe amatni mih, “Ang tekta iawng ang nachang ngengche kown pami enni tuk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni thow akhin mih pami achima ang tuk. <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />Enni che ang khi-ah mih mang ia tek ang dowi hanow enni naka ripra ngengche kown. Ang kowh kamrütra nataklowi kown padow enni ka tuak khai. Naiawng rakowi dai lai hown enni nakuan ang kownkow enni sangkrang khai. Kawmat ang khi-ah mih mang phat ang büa madiah. Nami mang che enni ia phat hanow nami auan paw enni ia phuang kown pami ang natuk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />Nakhowk khe nami sarauüa tek pe mang mih, “Anging tut-e kowh mangkri tukah kown nau mih auan nowng phuang mih maru lusa kowi amiapaw uowi dowi chekhai. Amia iawng mih lang kri lang kraing mih mang paw maiawng mih lawnguan kowi maiaklese sarauüa, süngnam tawn miuüa hai hawra sarauüa tut-e katpaw lünta dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" />Mangkri nauah iawng nachang kown mih dow lainowmma krat chekhai. Nami auan dow thuraiuüa klen kowi miapaw mangkri kowi nowng phuang pe kown nadowi; thuraiuüa dow lusa maru tut-e tawi uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />Nami laiklow tata hanow mangkri dow lainowmma kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Babulawn pren kowi kowh prengia pek miuüa maten kowi nakrawi saita bowk kownkow lawt ana khai. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" />Nahanow mang kowh ana pek dow krawi phuang khai bowt. Now Daniel hai a-auiuauüa kowi paw nasaila kownkow nakrawi cham kown mih maru krawi chin khai bowt.<verse eid="DAN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Prengia pek miuüa kowi nakrawi sai kownkow cham chinah mih mang chawng miuüa kowi kowh aluchow Ariuk kowi dow Daniel mih prengiama hown kaneuma klangah khai. <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />Ariuk kowi Daniel lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng khowt mih ana kraing mangkri tuk lawt khai?” pakhai. Nakhowk khe Ariuk dow nami lawnguan Daniel kowi phuang pe khai. <verse eid="DAN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Nami tata hanow Daniel dow mang tut-e kowkowi khai. Aia dow mang khi-ah mih mang uan naphuang pe kownkow mang tut-e kowlü akhin khai.<verse eid="DAN 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Nami kung kowi dow Daniel mih kim kowi kowplan hanow a-auiua Hanani, Misael hai Azaria büah kowi nami lawnguan kowlawp pe khai. <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" />Naiawng rakowi Daniel dow amatni tukah dowi mih lawnguan natukla kownkow mukuang Thurai tut-e nalü khowng kown mih a-auiua kowi tek pe khai. Naiawng amatni nalü khowng kown mih dow Babulawn pren kowi kowh prengia pek miuüa hown natawi kowng büah dowi kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" />Now tukah dowi mih lawnguan dow uar-e khe mukmang kowi Daniel kowi uang phuang pe khai. Nakhowk khe Daniel dow mukuang Thurai tut-e awr tek awmrawm lai khai.<verse eid="DAN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai kowi Daniel tek pe awmrawm lai mih</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" />Aia tek mih, “Thurai dow achowngma akiow pauowi reng lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:20">chanlaira hai kürra dow aia kowh chowtaih.<verse eid="DAN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />Khin hai ni ün paw aia low kowi aia towah reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:21">manguüa kowi dow mang chowm rah kowi aia pe chowmah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:21">now mang chowm rah hownia paw manguüa kowi aia klaah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:21">Chanlai miuüa kowi dow aia peah chanlaira reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:21">prengia uowi miuüa kowi dow aia peah prengia reng chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />Aia dow abüp hai apetma mih lawnguan phuang reng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:22">iiu dawng kowi tawng chow uowi mih ün aia tuk reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:22">now aia hown dow anowi tawi uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />Aw ang pipu-uüa kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:23">chanlaira hai kürra en pe ang khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">Naiawng rakowi ang tek en awmrawm lai hai ang kiow en.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 2:23">En tut-e tuk kown nau mih dow en pe tuk anging khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 2:23">mang kowh mang uan dow en phuang anging khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mangkri kowh mang hai auan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />Nami kung kowi dow Daniel mih Ariuk tut-e kowkowi khai. Ariuk dow mang kowh prengia pek miuüa kowi nasai kownkow mang towah mih chekhai. Daniel tek pe Ariuk mih, “Mang kowh prengia pek miuüa kowi hangkow sai diah. Mang tut-e kowpawla ang diah. Mang kowh mang uan ang phuang pe sow,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Daniel kowh laiklow tata hown krowksang Ariuk dow Daniel kowi mang tut-e kowpawla khai. Mangkri kowi Ariuk tek pe mih, “Mangkri, en kowh mang nowng phuang kown mih maru ang ka lowk ia khowk. Aia dow takhang mih Judauüa pungmadawng kowi kowh maru chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" />Daniel kowi hawah now mang lüntaah mih, “Ang kowh mang hai auan en nowng phuang ang kown bow?” pakhai. Daniel kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Beltesazar chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" />Daniel klangah mih, “Tukah dowi mih sia mangkri tuk kown nau mih dow mia iawng mih maru paw nowng phuang kown nadowi; chanlai miuüa, süngnam tawn uowi miuüa, maiaklese sarauüa hai hawra sarauüa paw nowng phuang kown nadowi. <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" />Nachenganchepaw tukah dowi mih sia nowng phuang mih mukuang Thurai uowi lowk ia. Aia dow pur prakowi kowh nauang phaw kown mih lawnguan mang Nebuknezar kowi uang pe tukah mih chekhai. Now en mawk rah kowi kowh en mang khi-ah mih auan dow kawmat ang natek en kown.<verse eid="DAN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />“Aw mangkri, phangbek kowi en mawk mih khin khe pur prakowi tawng chow naown kown mih lawnguan kowi en paw tuak khai. Tukah dowi mih sia tüng mih Thurai dow pur prakowi tawng chow naphaw kown mih lawnguan kowi uang tüng en mih chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" />Akeng miuüa lak-e ang lang chanlai khai rakowi tukah dowi mih sia ang tut-e uang tatüng mih nadowi. Nachenganchepaw aw mangkri, nami auan hai en kowh saktuak en natukla kownkow Thurai uang phuang ang mih chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />“Aw mangkri, en krawi tang mü hanow en pur kowi arup aiukma iowng mih en khi lowk khai. Nami arup dow aiukma, tawk pluplup hai apowm kramra uowima chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />Alu dow achangma mih kuh hown thawpah mih chekhai, abuk hai arut dow tai hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai, now amu hai thung dow kri hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai; <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />aklowng dow lawngha hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai, now khawkpha dow lawngha hai bawn hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" />En krawi tang mü mih khin khe hungh kowi kowh hua miapaw kakah dowi matchang taleu pasek mih en khi khai. Nami hua dow lawngha hai bawn hown kowh thawpah mih arup khawk kowi uang dowh hanow uang dita iawm khai. <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" />Nakhowk khe lawngha, bawn, kri, tai hai kuh ün dow tadi naknak khai. Naiawngün dow satma khin khe kowh bawk phai kowi dowh mih chapli iawng chekhai. Naiawngün di dow li uang hanow asaima rown khai. Tawkche nami arup kowi kowh uang dowh mih hua dow hungh aiukma uang chowng lowk khai, now palusama kowi krawi powngta khai.<verse eid="DAN 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />“Nami dow Mangkri khi-ah mih mang chekhai. Now kawmat dow nami auan mangkri kowi ang naphuang pe kown. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" />Aw mangkri, en dow mang maten kowh mang chekhai. En kowi dow mukuang Thurai mih mangra, nowng changra, kürra hai ringkawra ün pe en khai. <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" />CHAKRAMANG dow maru, tawncher hai uakling uaber hawmh luk kowi nachang alow kown mih tow en khai. Lowra re-e cham uowi chepaw amatni kowi dow en nimkrüa kowi aia towah khai. En dow nami kuh hown kowh thawpah mih lu chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" />“En kung kowi kowh nauang ta chowm mang kown mih dow en iawng nakri kraing kown nadowi bowt. Nami kung kowi paw mang nauang uowi lowk ia kown; nami mang dow kri hown kowh thawpah mih mu hai thung chekhai. Aia nimkrüa kowi dow palusama nauowi kown. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" />Achur prakowi lawngha iawng akhawtma mih mang nauang uowi lowk ia kown tak. Lawngha hown lowra chap nowng piak iawng nami mang dow akeng mih mang maten kowi adima napiakta kown. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />Mang lak kowi en khi-ah mih lawngha hai bawn hown kowh thawpah mih khawkpha hai khawkprüm auan dow pren tabak kown mih chekhai. Nami dow bawn hown taraw chepaw lawngha akhawtma mih iawng nakhawt ne kown. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Khawkpha hai khawkprüm kowi naiawng taraw mih en khi-ah iawng nami pren kowi kowh tawngbak mih pren bak dow nakür kown, now tawngbak mih pren bak dow akür nauowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />Lawngha hown bawn arawma mih auan dow pren kowi mih tapün talo mih hownia arawma nauowi kown mih chekhai. Tawkche lawngha hown bawn nowng tabawng dowi mih iawng pren kowi kowh maru-uüa mih chowngchowng saksakma natabawng kown nadowi.<verse eid="DAN 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" />“Naiawngün manguüa uowi mih khin khe mukuang Thurai mih nathawp pren lowk kown. Nami pren dow katpaw napiak kown nadowi bowt, now maru paw naia khün kown nadowi bowt. Nami pren dow akeng mih pren maten kowi napiakta naknak kown. Tawkche nami pren dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi kown. <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />Mami dow hungh hownia kowh taleu mih hua chekhai. Nami dow maru rut hown kowh leuah mih hua nadowi. Nami hua sek dow lawngha, kri, bawn, tai hai kuh kowi dita naknak mih chekhai. Pur pra naiawng nauang phaw kownkow kri kraingma mih Thurai mangkri kowi uang tüng pe mih chekhai. En khi-ah mih mang dow anowm chekhai, now auan paw kaah sakowm chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniel kowi mang peah awmrawm sung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />Nakhowk khe mang Nebuknezar mih Daniel pur kowi tabawkah krawm hanow Daniel kowi chupah khai, now Daniel pur kowi nauang chang phuchua kownkow hai nam iungma mih maikhük natowk kownkow aia maru-uüa kowi peah ana khai. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" />Daniel kowi mang tek pe mih, “Enni kowh Thurai dow akeng mih thuraiuüa kowh Thurai hai manguüa kowh Thurai chekhai. Aia dow maru tukah dowi mih lawnguan paw nowng phuang chekhai pami ang tuk khowk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en dow mami nowng phuangah dowi mih lawnguan nowng phuang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" />Nami kung kowi dow Daniel kowi aiukma mih arah mang peah khai, now kri kraingma mih awmrawm sung paw ahuma peah khai. Aia kowi dow Babulawn paprenma kowi kowh kruitown miuüa kowi lang kri mih mang towah khai. Now nami pren kowi kowh prengia pek miuüa luk kowi nachang alow kown mih kurdik paw Daniel kowi aia peah khai. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Nami klen kowi Daniel lü rakowi Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah kowi paw Babulawn pren kowi kowh maru iukra mang peah khai. Tawkche Daniel dow mang kim kowi uowi khai.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s">Kuh hown Nebuknezar thawp arup mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Mang Nebuknezar dow kuh hown akro 60 muk hai aiuk 6 muk mih arup thawp lowk khai, now nami arup dow Babulawn pren kowi kowh Dura nai kowi aia towah khai. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Nami kung kowi aia dow nami arup ap pawi kowi nauang tawi sun kownkow pren bak kowi kowh kruitown miuüa, aluchowuüa, prengia pek miuüa, tangka mingkhet miuüa, tara chet miuüa, akeng mih tara chet miuüa hai akeng mih maru iukuüa maten kowi hawah khai. <verse eid="DAN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün maru-uüa dow mang Nebuknezar thawpah mih arup ap pawi kowi uang takua talawm büah khai, now nami arup pur kowi uang iowng büah khai.<verse eid="DAN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Nakhowk khe mang kowh lai phuang mih dow atünma tek mih, “Palusama kowi kowh chen towng chap towng maru-uüa low, mangkri kowh ana pek sünta büa diah. <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />Enni mih baw, plung, tingteng, taraw, prui hai akeng mih tünteu chap maiow tün ta hown akrowksang tabawk krawm se mang Nebuknezar thawpah mih kuh hown kowh arup kowi nachup kown. <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" />Now tawi chup dowi mih maru kowi dow lün pluplup mih maih khawng kowi nakuakah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />Naiawng rakowi naiawngün tünteu ta hanow palusama kowi kowh chen towng chap towng maru-uüa dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se kuh hown kowh mang Nebuknezar thawpah mih arup kowi chup büah khai.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maih khawng kowi Daniel büah kowi kuakah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />Nami khin khe Kaldai chenchap maru pre sum ia mih mang tut-e kowkowi hanow Jihudiuüa lawnguan kowi kowchawk lai khai. <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" />Amatni tek pe Nebuknezar mih, “Aw mangkri, chowngdawng sakklangma en pacham sing reng lah. <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />Baw, tingteng, taraw, prui hai akeng mih tünteu chap maiow tün ta hown krowksang tabawk krawm se en thawpah mih arup kowi nachup ngengche kown mih en pe ana khowk. <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />Tawi chup dowi mih maru kowi dow lün pluplup mih maih khawng kowi nakuakah kown padow en tek khai. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" />Tawkche aw mangkri, Babulawn pren kowi mang lup chang mih en pawah mih Jihudi maru pre sum ia dow en kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai. Amatni dow en kowh thuraiuüa hai kuh hown kowh en thawpah mih arup kowi tawi chup dowi chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Nami laiklow tata hanow mang Nebuknezar dow lainowmma kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah kowi nauang hawla kownkow kowchin maru khai. Now kowbüah kowi dow mang pur kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Nakhowk khe kowbüah kowi mang Nebuknezar tek pe mih, “Aw Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago, ang kowh thuraiuüa kowi enni tawi chup dowi pe dow? Now kuh hown kowh ang thawpah mih arup kowi paw enni tawi chup dowi pe dow? <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" />Kawmat enni che baw, tingteng, taraw, parui hai akeng mih tünteu chap maiow tün ta hown krowksang kuh hown kowh ang thawpah mih arup kowi tawi chupiia kown nau now iung. Tawkche tawi chupiia dowi hanow lün pluplup mih maih khawng kowi ang nakuak enni kown. Nakhowk khe amia iawng mih thurai paw ang rut hownia uang ia lawng enni kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Nakhowk khe mang Nebuknezar kowi Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah tek pe, “Aw mangkri Nebuknezar, mami lawnguan kowi klang en kown takla pami anging ka tuak dowi. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Anging rowsi kiowriah mih Thurai che nau hanow aia dow nami lün pluplup mih maih khawng hai en rut hownia nauang lawng anging kown taih. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" />Nachenganchepaw aw mangkri, nami hownia aia lawng anging dowi chepaw en kowh thuraiuüa kowi anging natawi chup kown nadowi, now kuh hown kowh en thawpah mih arup kowi paw anging natawi chup kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Nakhowk khe Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah luk kowi Nebuknezar mih lainowmma kunmarau khai, now aia dow kunmarau lai bowt kowh lumowr minma towbowt. Aia dow maih khawng aiawng den mih lak-e ranit dungna nalang denah kownkow pe ana khai. <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />Nami kung kowi aia dow sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah kowi tawmah now lün pluplup mih maih kuam kowi nakuakah kownkow aia kowh siphai pungmadawng kowi kowh lang kür mih pre sum ia kowi peah ana khai. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />Nakhowk khe amatni sum ia kowi dow kowrmow, klowngkrua dawngh, napawng hai akeng mih tawnguat khupma hown tawmah now lün pluplup mih maih kuam kowi kuakah khai. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Mang kowh ana pek khawt lai rakowi hai maih kuam kowi kowh maih den lai rakowi Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah kowi maih kuam kowi kowkuakah mih maru-uüa dow maih den hown kowng khai. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" />Now kowbüah sum ia dow atawmiama hown lün pluplup mih maih kuam kowi tanawm khai.<verse eid="DAN 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Nakhowk khe mang Nebuknezar mih lainowmma awda khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow alenma awr rü hanow aia kowh prengia pek miuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Maru sum ia kowi nadowi bow tawmah now maih kowi a-i kuakah?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 3:24">Now amatni klangah mih, “Na chowdiah le mangkri,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" />Amatni kowi mang tek pe mih, “Tawkche maih dawng kowi maru len tali ia mih ang khi. Amatni dow atawmiama nadowi, now kam paw kam dowi chekhai. Nami tali ia mih pungmadawng kowi kowh lowk ia mih dow apowm thurai iawng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />Nakhowk khe Nebuknezar dow lün pluplup mih maih kuam plawt re-e kowkowi hanow atünma tek mih, “Aw lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowh nar Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago, maih hownia uang lawt büa diah,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 3:26">Nahanow Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah dow maih hownia uang lawt khai bowt. <verse eid="DAN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" />Nakhowk khe pren bak kowi kowh kruitown miuüa, aluchowuüa, prengia pek miuüa hai akeng mih maru iukuüa maten dow kowbüah re-e akawmma uang tachun khai. Amatni dow Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah kowi maih kamah dowi mih, samiang aiangchow khowm kam dowi mih hai tawnguat paw kam dowi mih khi büah khai. Now amatni buk kowi maih nam khowm ta büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />Nakhowk khe Nebuknezar tek mih, “Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. Aia dow aia kowh kramamu kowi uang chin pe hanow aia naruüa kowi lawngah khai. Amatni dow amatni kowh Thurai luk kowi owmsak rakowi ang kowh ana pek chün dowi mih chekhai. Amatni dow amatni kowh Thurai klen kowi akeng mih thuraiuüa hai arup kowi chupiia kown nau dowi rakowi kowng khowm uam takham büah khai. <verse eid="DAN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" />Naiawng rakowi mami ana ang pe khowk. Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah kowh Thurai kowi kingküala mih laiklow palusama kowi kowh chen towng chap towng maru-uüa naia tek kown nadowi. Tek mih maru kowi dow nadungta naknak kown, now aia kowh kim dow nachangla mawngchawng kuakra kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amia iawng mih thurai paw naiawng nowngia lawng dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Nami kung kowi mang dow Sadrak, Mesak hai Abednago büah kowi Babulawn pren kowi kowh arah lang iuk mih peah khai.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="s">Nebuknezar plan khi mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />Akung kowi dow mang Nebuknezar mih palusama kowi kowh chen towng chap towng maru-uüa tut-e mami satang krawi phuang khai: Enni tut-e thaulangra ahuma pacham uowi lah. <verse eid="DAN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" />Lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai dow ang vüi amatra lup hai awdara lup maten tüng ang khai. Naiawng rakowi nami dow awmrawmma hown ang phuang enni mih chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />Aia kowh amatra lup ün dow kri kraingma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 4:3">now aia kowh awdara lup ün paw awdara uowima chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:3">Aia kowh mang chowm rah dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 4:3">now aia kowh kruitownra paw chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />Ang Nebuknezar mih mang kim kowi asowrma hai apiawma ang uowi khai. <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />Phangbek kowi ang mawk mih khin khe ang khi mang lowk. Nami mang lak kowi kowh ang khi-ah mih dow lainowmma kramra uowi khai. Naiawng rakowi ang kram khai. <verse eid="DAN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />Naiawng rakowi ang mang khi-ah mih auan naphuang ang kownkow Babulawn pren kowi kowh mang prengia pek mih maten kowi ang pur kowi nauang pawla kownkow ang pe ana khai. <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" />Maiaklese sarauüa, süngnam tawn miuüa, mantan sarauüa hai hawra sarauüa ang tut-e uang towm hanow ang khi-ah mih mang amatni kowi ang phat pe khai. Tawkchedow amatni mih nami mang uan nowng phuang ang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" />Achur kowi Daniel mih ang pur kowi uang hanow aia kowi dow ang khi-ah mih mang ang phat pe khai. (Aia kowi dow maiawngün uang phaw dowi rawn ang kowh thurai ming iawng Beltesazar pahai ang rük pe ming khai). Aia tut-e dow chimsaima mih thuraiuüa lümla uowi chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" />Ang tek pe mih, “Aw maiaklese sarauüa kowi kowh lang kri mih Beltesazar, en tut-e dow chimsaima mih thuraiuüa lümla uowi mih ang tuk. Now en tut-e dow tukah dowi mih chap natuk kown mih akratma nadowi chekhai. Mami ang mang khi-ah mih auan phuang ang diah. <verse eid="DAN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" />Phangbek kowi ang mawk mih khin khe mami mukmang ang khi khai. Ang tang mü hanow lusa dawnglang kowi alowngma mih singh iowng dawnglawng mih ang khi lowk khai. <verse eid="DAN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />Nami singh dow awr iuk hanow aiukma hai akhawtma uang phaw khai. Now nami singh chem dow kuang kowi tawk khai; nami singh dow prenchur nammowt hownia paw nowngia khi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" />Nami singh kowi kowh aram ün dow lainowmma klangiung khai, now auih paw lainowmma chak khai. Nami singh hownia dow maru maten ka chakkham khai. Nami singh klim kowi dow tawncher hawmh ka tanaira khai, now kuang dawng kowi kowh uakling uaber hawmh paw nami singh mia kowi ka chang bai khai. Asak uowi mih maten nami singh hownia ka chakkham reng chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />“Phangbek kowi ang mawk mih khin khe nami mukmang kowi ang krawi tang mü khai, now chimsaima mih satang phowng mih lowk ia kowi mukuang pren hownia uang iu dowm mih ang khi khai. <verse eid="DAN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" />Nami maru atünma tek mih, ‘Nami singh kripta diah, amia maten paw pletta diah; aram ün paw rawtta bowk diah, now auih ün dow howngta bowk diah. Nahanow nami singh krüa kowi kowh uowi mih tawncher hai singh mia kowi kowh uowi mih uakling uaber ün napowt kown towbowt. <verse eid="DAN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />Tawkchedow nami singh ngut hai singh prün dow lawngha hai kri hown atawmiama krawng kowi kowh bawrchak dawng kowi pacham uowi lah. Mukuang hownia kowh nang tui hown aia dow pacham sik lah, now lusa kowi kowh singh rüm kauche dawng kowi asaduauüa hown pacham taiua uowi lah. <verse eid="DAN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />Aia kowh dow lusa maru sangching hang pacham uowi tham bowt lah. Aia kowi dow ranit ning mowr asadua sangching pacham peah lah.<verse eid="DAN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" />“‘Mami ana dow satang phowng mih chimsaima mih kramamu-uüa krawi phuang khai. Naiawng amatni krawi phuang mih dow chowm mang mih maru-uüa luk kowi ün lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai chang alow reng pami sing uowi miuüa natukla reng kownkow chekhai, now aia nau mih maru kowi aia pe chowmah mang reng pami hai maru pungmadawng kowi kowh lang sowm mih maru kowi dow maru luk kowi nachang alow kown mih aia towah reng pami natukla kownkow chekhai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" />“Mami mang dow ang Nebuknezar khi-ah mih chekhai. Aw Beltesazar, nami tawng auan chow mih kawmat sam phuang ang madiah. Nami auan dow ang pren kowi kowh prengia pek miuüa miapaw ia phuang ang dowi chekhai. Tawkche en dow naia phuang ang kown taih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en tut-e dow chimsaima mih thuraiuüa lümla uowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniel phuang mang uan mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />Nakhowk khe Daniel dow mangkri kowh mang uan tukta hanow kram khai, now mawlawma uowi sangrum khai. Daniel dow Beltesazar chekhai. Nahanow mangkri tek pe Daniel mih, “Aw Beltesazar, ang kowh mang hai nami auan naphuang ang kown mih hangkow tuak krat diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:19">Beltesazar klangah mih, “Aw ang kowh chakramang, mami mang hai auan dow en ransu-uüa luk kowi pacham kla lah. <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />Mang kowi kowh en khi-ah mih singh dow aiukma hai akhawtma chekhai, now nami singh chem dow kuang kowi tawk khai. Now nami singh dow lusa maru maten khi-ah bowk chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" />Nami singh dow aram klangiungma hai auih achakma chekhai, nami singh hownia dow maru ka chakkham reng. Now dowm kowi kowh tawncher hawmh paw nami singh klim kowi ka tanai reng, now amia kowi paw uakling hawmh ka chang bai reng chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" />Aw mangkri, nami singh dow en chekhai. En dow kri kraingma hai akürma chekhai. En kowh kür dow kraing lai bowt kowh kuang kowi tawk khai bowt, now en kowh mangra dow prenchur nammowt mowr cham krawi tauet khai bowt.<verse eid="DAN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />“Aw mangkri, chimsaima mih satang phowng mih kramamu lowk ia dow mukuang pren hownia uang iu dowm mih en khi khai. Aia tek en mih, ‘Nami singh kripta diah. Tawkchedow nami singh ngut hai singh prün dow lawngha hai kri hown atawmiama krawng kowi kowh bawrchak dawng kowi pacham uowi lah. Mukuang pren hownia kowh nang tui hown aia dow pacham sik reng lah, now lusa kowi kowh singh rüm kauche dawng kowi asaduauüa hown ranit ning mowr pacham taiua uowi lah,’ pah en khai.<verse eid="DAN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />“Aw mangkri, kawmat kowh ang tekah mih dow ang kowh chakramang khi-ah mih mang uan chekhai. Naiawngün dow Thurai kowh ana pek iawng en luk kowi nauang phaw kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" />En kowi dow maru-uüa hownia naprütta en kown. Nahanow asaduauüa hown en natawi taiua uowi kown. Chiala iawng dow en nacha pram kown. Now mukuang hownia kowh nang tui hown en nasik kown. Naiawng hai ranit ning mowr en nauowi kown. Ranit ning kung kowi dow maru luk kowi lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai chang alow reng mih hai aia nauah mih kowi aia pe chowmah mang reng pami en natuk kown. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Now aprün hailawm singh ngut natowah kown mih ana pek auan dow mami chekhai: Mukuang Thurai chowtaih chang alow reng pami en chün khü chiang en kowh pren mih naplan pe en iawk kown pami chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" />Naiawng rakowi aw mangkri, ang kowh prengia pek chün diah. Chang lup iung reng diah, ngarawng ngarai miuüa kowi saksing sanaah diah, now en kowh angak hai aprek dow towta diah. Nahanow en kowh iungra mih anikma uowi chepaw naia kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28-30" />Maiawngün maten dow mang Nebuknezar luk kowi uang own khai. Aia khi mang mih laipre la kung kowi aia dow Babulawn kowi kowh aia kimluk kowi krawi len khai. Nami khin khe aia tek mih “Ang nakala kiowrira kownkow ang kowh kür akraingma mih hown klangiungma ang thawpah mih marow kri dow mami Babulawn marow chowbowt nadowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:28-30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" />Naiawng aia tek reng tak khe mukuang hownia mia iawng mih chünchü aia kowi uang tek pe mih, “Aw mang Nebuknezar, en kowh pren dow en rut hownia pawta en khai bowt pami ang uang tek en mih chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" />En kowi dow maru-uüa hownia naprütta en kown. Nahanow asaduauüa hown en natawi taiua uowi kown. Chiala iawng dow en nacha pram kown. Now mukuang hownia kowh nang tui hown en nasik kown. Naiawng hai ranit ning mowr en nauowi kown. Nakhowk khe dow maru luk kowi lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai chang alow reng mih hai aia nauah mih kowi aia pe chowmah mang reng pami en natuk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />Nebuknezar lawnguan kowi kowh tekah mih srui dow nami khin khe uang tachi khai bowt. Aia kowi dow maru-uüa hownia prütta khai bowt, now aia dow chiala iawng cha pram khai bowt. Aia kowh kow dow mukuang nang tui hown sik khai bowt. Aia kowh sam dow uamu pawi iawng uang own khai bowt, now aia kowh rutmi khawkmi ün dow uamu kowh khawkse iawng uang own khai bowt.<verse eid="DAN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nebuknezar kiow Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />Naiawngün ni chur kung kowi dow ang Nebuknezar mih mukuang prakowi awr tang mü khai, now ang kowh sak uang plan iung khai bowt. Nakhowk khe lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowi ang kiowah hai ang chupiiaah khai, chowngchowng saksakma sing uowi mih kowi ang ringkawah khai. Ang tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:34">“Thurai kowh pren dow achowngma mih pren chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 4:34">now aia kowh mangra dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35" />Lusa kowi kowh maru maten dow aia tut-e tawngpaw nadowi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 4:35">Aia dow kramamu-uüa hai lusa maru-uüa kowi aia nau iawng changah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 4:35">Aia kowi dow, ‘Tawng chow en chang?’ pahai nalüntaah kown mih miapaw uowi dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 4:35">now aia kowi nahangah kown mih maru paw amiapaw uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36" />Ang kowh sak ching mih khin khe ang kowh pren ringkawra nauowila iawk kownkow ang kowh klangiungra hai kiowrira mih plan pe ang khai iawk. Now ang kowh maru iukuüa hai aluchowuüa dow krawi plan cham ang khai, now ang kowi plan pe chowm ang mang khai iawk. Nahanow ang dow auown khe kowh lak-e uang lang kri kraing khai bowt. <verse eid="DAN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37" />Kawmat dow ang Nebuknezar mih mukuang kowi kowh mang kowi rowsi, kiowri hai ringkawah khowk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia changah mih srui dow anama chekhai. Now aia kowh tiama maten dow anowmma kangowh chekhai. Chang bawri miuüa kowi dow aia nowngia piak chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s">Kimbang kowi cha uang tarui mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Ning ahuma rawn kung kowi mang Belsazar mih aia kowh 1,000 ia mih maru iukuüa vüi chang pe pawi kri lowk khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow naiawngün maru-uüa hown taiua kham grep tui khai. <verse eid="DAN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" />Naiawng kham grep tui mih khin khe kuh hai tai hown kowh bia nauang pawla kownkow mang Belsazar lawt ana khai. Naiawngün bia dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim hownia Belsazar kowh pa Nebuknezar uang pawla mih chekhai. Naiawng mang Belsazar lawt ana mih dow naiawngün bia hown aia, aia kowh maru iukuüa, amasiuüa hai aia changla masi mih narmauüa nakhamla grep tui kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />Naiawngün bia uang pawla hanow mang hai aia kowh maru iukuüa, aia kowh masi hai changla masi mih narmauüa mih naiawngün bia hown kham grep tui khai. <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" />Khamla grep tui se amatni dow kuh, tai, kri, lawngha, singh hai hua hown kowh thawpah mih arup kowi kiowri büah khai.<verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />Nakhowk khe mang kim kowi kowh maibu towng re-e maru rut uang tatüng hanow kimbang kowi uang rui cha lutlut khai. Naiawng uang rui cha lutlut khe nami rut dow mang khi khai. <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" />Nami khita hanow aia dow lainowmma kram khai, now aia kowh lumowr dow müakangma phaw khai. Now aia kowh kungh hai klowng dow chür klukluk khai bowt. <verse eid="DAN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" />Nami khin khe mang dow süngnam tawn miuüa, püi howng sarauüa hai hawra sarauüa kowi nauang hawla kownkow atünma lawt ana khai. Babulawn pren kowi kowh naiawngün prengia pek miuüa uang ting khe mangkri tek pe mih, “Mami cha rui tuk phat mih hai mami auan nowng phuang ang mih kowi dow ang nakhup pe aruama mih uan kown, now ang na-ü pe kuh leng kown. Ang pren kowi kowh kruitown mih sum ia kowi lowk ia mih arah ang napeah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" />Naiawngün prengia pek miuüa dow alak kowi uang tawkche nami cha rui mih phat paw tuk phat dowi, now auan paw hing tuk phuang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />Naiawng rakowi mang Belsazar dow lang kram ngamlam khai, now aia kowh lumowr paw müakangma lang phaw ngamlam khai. Aia kowh maru iukuüa paw mawlawma own bowk khai.<verse eid="DAN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />Mang hai aia kowh maru iukuüa kowh laiklow tata hanow mang kowh u mih pawi chakra kim kowi uang khai. Now Belsazar kowi aia tek pe mih, “Mangkri ow, chowngdawng sakklangma en pacham sing reng lah. Hangkow kram diah, en kowh lumowr müakangma hangkow towah diah. <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" />En kowh pren kowi maru uowi lowk ia tak; aia tut-e dow chimsaima mih lümla uowi chekhai. Nami dow lusa hownia kowh aia kaah mih chap nadowi. En pa Nebuknezar chowng khe nami maru tut-e tukra, prengia hai thuraiuüa kowh iawng mih chanlaira uowi chekhai. Nami maru kowi dow maiaklese sara, süngnam tawn miuüa, püi howng sara hai hawra sarauüa kowi kowh lang kri mih arah Nebuknezar peah khai. <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" />Nami maru ming dow Daniel chekhai. En pa dow nami Daniel kowi Beltesazar pahai hawah khai. Aia tut-e dow chanlaira, prengia, nowng phuang mang mih kür, nowng phuangla <char style="w">laipet</char> mih kür uowi chekhai, now aia dow akrat pusara ahuma chepaw krat dowi iawng nowng chang reng chekhai. Nami Daniel kowi phai nakowhaw kownkow kowchin maru diah. Aia chowtaih nami cha uan nanowng tek en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniel phuang pe cha uan mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Now Daniel kowi dow mang pur kowi maru uang pawla khai bowt. Daniel kowi mang lüntaah mih, “En chowbowt bow Daniel? Juda pren hownia kowh apa uang khümla mih en chowbowt bow? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" />Lusa hownia kowh nadowi mih tukra, prengia hai amülüngma mih chanlaira en tut-e uowi pe pami ang ta. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />Mami cha rui naphat hanow naphuang ang auan kownkow sarauüa hai prengia pek miuüa kowi ang uang hawla khowk chowdiah. Tawkche nami auan nowng phuang ang büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />En dow apetma mih chap kowi kowh auan nowng tek mih hai akratma mih chap aiachow nowng chang pami ang ta. En che mami cha nowng phat hai nami auan nowng phuang ang khai hanow aruama mih uan nakhup en kown, now ngawng kowi na-ü en kuh leng kown. Nami klen kowi mami pren kowi kowh kruitown mih sum ia kowi lowk ia mih arah ang nape en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />Nami khin khe Daniel tek pe mang mih, “En kowh awmrawm sung en tut-e pacham uowi lah, nadowi now akeng miuüa kowi peah diah. Nachenganchepaw nami cha rui ang naphat en hanow auan mih ang naphuang en kown taih. <verse eid="DAN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" />Aw mangkri, lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai dow en pa Nebuknezar kowi mangra, kürra, kraingra hai ringkawra peah khai. <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />Naiawng aia kowi peah kür rakowi palusama kowi kowh chen towng chap towng maru-uüa dow aia kowi kram kowh chür büah khai. Aia nau mih kowi dow aia saiah reng, nau mih kowi dow aia towah sing reng, nau mih kowi dow aia peah iukra reng, now nau mih kowi dow asung uowi dowi iawng aia changah reng chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" />Nachenganchepaw aia dow chang owrow hai chang bawri khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia kowh mang chowm rah hai ringkawra dow Thurai pawta pe khai. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" />Aia kowi dow lusa maru uowi rah hownia prütta hanow asadua sangching tow pe khai. Aia dow kaurawng kawrngaramchük hawmh hown taiua uowi khai, chiala hawmh hown taiua cha pram khai, now nang tui kowi sik paklak chekhai. Naiawng aia uowi mih dow palusama pren kowi chang alow mih lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai chowtaih, now aia nau mih kowi dow aia pe chowmah mang reng pami aia taphuang dowi mowr chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />“Aw Belsazar, en dow mang Nebuknezar kowh chapa chekhai. Naiawngün dow en tuk bowk khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw khamsum khamdawma hown en uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" />Bawrima hown mukuang Thurai kowi en kingküa khai. Aia kim hownia kowh uang pawla mih bia dow en uang pawla khai, now en, en kowh maru iukuüa, en kowh masi hai en changla masi mih narmauüa hown naiawngün bia hown enni kham grep tui khai. Now tai, kuh, kri, lawngha, singh hai hua hown kowh thawpah mih arup kowi enni rowsiah khai. Naiawngün arup dow khi paw khi dowi, ta paw ta dowi, now tukta paw tukta dowi chekhai. Tawkche pe en kawli mih hai kruitown en mih Thurai kowi dow en kiowri dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />Naiawng rakowi Thurai mih uang chin rut hanow nami cha uang rui en mih chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />“Nami cha kowi arui uowi mih dow, ‘MENE, MENE, TEKEL hai PARSIN,’ pah chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />Naiawngün auan dow maiawng: MENE pami dow ‘rüaah’ pami chekhai. En chowm mang mih ni maten Thurai rüata en khowk, now nami ni dow chur mih chowbowt. <verse eid="DAN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" />TEKEL pami dow ‘khaiah’ pami chekhai. Thurai mih set kowi khai en khowk, now en kowh dik mih lang e khai. <verse eid="DAN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" />PARSIN pami dow ‘retah’ pami chekhai. En kowh pren dow Mediauüa hai Persiauüa kowi Thurai retta pe khai bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />Nakhowk khe Belsazar kowh ana hown Daniel kowi mih khup pe aruama mih uan hai ngawng kowi ü pe kuh leng khai. Now pren kowi kowh kruitown mih sum ia kowi lowk ia mih arah Daniel kowi napeah kown mih laiklow paw phuang khai.<verse eid="DAN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" />Nami iak khe Babulawn pren mang Belsazar kowi dow ransu-uüa mih uang saita khai. <verse eid="DAN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31" />Now Media prenchak Darius mih ta chowm mang khai. Nakhowk khe Darius dow 62 ning khowk chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s">Krangsi khawng kowi Daniel kowi kuakah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Mang Darius dow aia kowh pren mih changah 120 bak khai. Naiawngün pren bak kowi dow tow pe kruitown mih lowk ia chi khai. <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />Now naiawngün pren bak kowi kowh kruitown mih maten luk kowi dow aia tow pe lang kri mih sum ia khai. Nami sum ia mih kowi Daniel paw na lowk ia chekhai. Mangkri luk kowi tawngpaw piakra nauang tingla dowi kownkow pren kruitown miuüa maten kowi nami lang kri mih sum ia dak kowi towah khai. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" />Daniel dow akeng mih lang kri miuüa hai kruitown miuüa lak-e lang tuk chang lup khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow pren paprenma luk kowi natowah kruitown mih kownkow mangkri tatuak khai. <verse eid="DAN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" />Naiawng rakowi pren kruitown miuüa hai lang kri miuüa mih chowra lup prakowi Daniel kowh atawi ama uowi mih nakhüm pe kownkow kamrüt khai. Tawkche Daniel dow kaah sakowmma chang lup reng rakowi tawng iawng mih atawi ama paw ka khüm büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />Achur kowi naiawngün maru-uüa tatek mih, “Daniel kowi nakingküaah kownkow tawng iawng mih atawi ama paw a-i naka kown nadowi. Aia kowh kawngmu kowi chowtaih a-i naka pe atawi ama kown,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="DAN 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />Naiawng rakowi lang kri miuüa hai pren bak kowi kowh kruitown miuüa dow ahawmsang mang tut-e kowkowi khai. Now mang kowi tek pe büah mih, “Mangkri Darius, chowngdawng sakklangma en pacham sing lah. <verse eid="DAN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />En pren kowi kowh lang kri miuüa, pren bak kowi kowh kruitown miuüa, prengia pek miuüa hai akeng mih maru iukuüa dow akhawtma en nathawp ari kown mih nauta bowk chekhai. Nami ari dow maiawng: En klen kowi 30 ni mowr tawng iawng mih arup hai tawng iawng mih maru kowi naia chupiia kown nadowi; cham chupiia mih maru kowi dow krangsi khawng kowi nakuakah kown. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" />Aw mangkri, nami ana pek nowng klowila dowi bowt kownkow ruiah diah. Nami paw Media pren hai Persia pren kowi kowh nowng klowiah dowi bowt mih rirow pana lah,” pape khai. <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Naiawng rakowi mang Darius dow nami ana charam kowi tuk pe mur khai.<verse eid="DAN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />Ana charam kowi mang tukta mur mih tata hanow Daniel dow aia kowh aluk krowng kim kowi kowkowi khai. Now aia kowh kiang iawng pani kowi sum kat chi tua kungh se Thurai tut-e tek awmrawm lai khai. Nami kim kowi kowh tawngpawk dow Jerusalem marow prakowi taho hüah chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün maru iukuüa mih ahawmsang nakowi kowkowi khai, now Daniel chup Thurai mih hai Thurai tut-e lü khowng mih kowkhi büah khai. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow mang tut-e kowkowi hanow aia lawtah mih ana kowplau pe khai. Amatni tek pe mih, “Aw mangkri, en klen kowi 30 ni mowr tawng iawng mih arup hai tawng iawng mih maru kowi naia chupiia kown nadowi; cham chupiia mih maru kowi dow krangsi khawng kowi nakuakah kown pami en lawtta ana khowk nadowi bow?” pabüah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:12">Mangkri klangah mih, “Ow, ang lawtta khowk. Nami ana dow nowng klowi dowi bowt. Nami dow Media pren hai Persia pren kowi kowh chowra rirow iawng akhawtma uowi reng chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün maru iukuüa tek pe mih, “Aw mangkri, Juda pren hownia kowh uang khümla mih Daniel pami dow en kowh laiklow hai en tuk pe mur khowk mih ana pek kowi chün dowi chekhai. Aia dow kawmat paw ani kowi sum kat chi aia kowh Thurai kowi chup reng chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="DAN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />Nami laiklow tata hanow mang dow lainowmma tuak krat khai, now aia dow Daniel kowi nalawngah kown mih tatuak khai. Aia dow Daniel kowi naia lawngla kownkow sat kup dowi mowr sangkrang khai.<verse eid="DAN 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />Nami kung kowi naiawngün maru-uüa dow ahawmsang mang tut-e kowplan kowi khai iawk. Now amatni tek pe mih, “Aw mangkri, Media pren hai Persia pren kowi kowh chowra rirow kowi dow mang lawtta khowk mih ana nowng klowi dowi bowt pami en aiawng tuk,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" />Achur kowi mang peta ana hanow maru-uüa mih Daniel kowi khümla khai, now krangsi khawng kowi kowkuakah khai. Nakowi kuakah dowi rawn mangkri tek pe Daniel mih, “En chupiiaah reng mih Thurai pacham lawng en lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="DAN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" />Nami kung kowi dow uang pawla hua lowk hanow nami khawng mowr kowi uang büngah khai. Now Daniel kowi miapaw naia lawngah dowi bowt kownkow nami hua kowi mangkri kowh mur hai maru iukuüa kowh mur tuk pe khai. <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" />Nami kung kowi dow mang Darius mih aia kim kowi kowpowt khai. Nami iak dow tawngpaw cha dowi kham dowi kowi aia uowi khai, now Daniel rakowi mia kowi paw pe piaw pe paah dowi chekhai. Nami iak dow mapaw aia nowng müi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Now auai rau uar thowi how thowi dowi how tak khe aia dow awr rü hanow alenma Daniel kowi kuakah mih krangsi khawng pra kowkowi khai. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" />Now krangsi khawng re-e kowting hown krowksang aia dow kar klu tapang hüah se Daniel kowi hawah now tek pe mih, “Masing Thurai kowh nar Daniel, krangsi nawr hownia en chupiiaah reng mih Thurai uang nowng lawng en nadowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />Nakhowk khe Daniel hawt klangah mih, “Aw mangkri, chowngdawng sakklangma en pacham sing reng lah. <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" />Ang kowh Thurai mih aia kowh kramamu kowi uang chin ang hanow uang kowpta pe krangsi nawr bowk khai. Krangsi hawmh mih tawngpaw chang ang dowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Thurai mik kowi dow ang kowh atawi ama uowi dowi chekhai. Aw mangkri, en tut-e paw ang kowh atawi ama uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" />Nakhowk khe mang Darius mih lainowmma awmrawm khai, now krangsi khawng hownia Daniel kowi nauang lawtla kownkow pe ana khai. Daniel uang lawt khowk khe Daniel buk kowi tawng iawng mih ma paw uowi dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow Thurai luk kowi neplawng nesak reng chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" />Now Daniel kowi irsiah kowh khüm pe atawi miuüa kowi nauang pawla kownkow mang lawt ana khai, now naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow amatni hai amatni kowh masi chauüa hailawm nami krangsi khawng kowi kuakah khai. Nami kuam phai kowi kowdowh dowi rawn amatni kowi dow krangsi hawmh mih ahut hailawm hawt thük hawt iaita nak khai.<verse eid="DAN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />Nami kung kowi dow mang Darius mih palusama kowi kowh chen towng chap towng maru-uüa vüi maiawng rui chasak lowk khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:25">“Enni luk kowi iungra ahuma pauowi lah!<verse eid="DAN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" />Mami ana ang lawtta khowk.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 6:26">Ang pren kowi kowh maru maten Daniel kowh Thurai kowi nakramah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 6:26">now naring nakawah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:26">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow masing Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 6:26">now aia dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:26">Aia kowh pren dow napiak kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 6:26">now aia kowh mangra paw katpaw nachur kown nadowi.<verse eid="DAN 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />Aia dow aia kowh maru-uüa kowi khowngah reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 6:27">now lawngah reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 6:27">Aia dow krawng hai mukuang kowi maiow maiow lakkhiara lup tüng reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 6:27">Aia dow krangsi nawr hownia Daniel kowi lawngah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />Naiawng hown Darius hai Persia mang Kuras chowm mang khe Daniel mih aiungma ka uowi khai.<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="s">Daniel mang khi-ah mih kaurawng uaramchak tali chap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1-2" />Babulawn pren kowi Belsazar uown chowm mang mih ning khe mang lak kowi achap ahuma Daniel khi khai. Mang lak kowi kowh aia khi-ah mih lawnguan dow maiawng aia ruiah khai,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 7:1-2">“Uar-e khe mang lak kowi mukuang tali tingnui hownia li uangah hanow sata aiukma mih kowi uang hutah mih ang khi khai. <verse eid="DAN 7:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" />Nami khin khe nami sata hownia kaurawng uaramchak aiukma mih uang awr towk tali klüng khai. Naiawngün kaurawng uaramchak dow apowm alang alangma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" />Lowk mih dow krangsi powm iawng panow uamu kowh iawng alap uowi chekhai. Ang tang müah reng tak khe aia kowh lap pre buk mih dow thükta pe hanow aia kowi mih krawng kowi awr pe iowngah khai. Nahanow aia dow maru iawng klowng pre chüng hown iowng dawnglawng khai, now aia kowi dow maru saktuak peah khai bowt.<verse eid="DAN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" />“Nami kung kowi dow pre kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak ang plan khi lowk iawk. Nami dow tawm powm iawng. Aia dow purdowng khawk hown iowng dawnglawng khai, now aia nawr kowi dow aia cham makah mih chak hut uowi sum buk chekhai. Aia kowi tek pe mih, ‘Awr rü now en du pat cham cha chaknga diah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" />“Nami kung kowi paw sum kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak ang plan khi lowk iawk. Nami dow pri rengchow powm iawng chekhai. Aia kum kowi dow uakling kowh iawng alap uowi tali klüng chekhai, now alu paw uowi tali klüng. Aia kowi dow nachang alow kown mih kür peah khai.<verse eid="DAN 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" />“Nami kung kowi paw tali kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak ang plan khi lowk iawk. Nami dow kramra uowima, now kür paw akürma chekhai. Aia kowh iüng dow aiukma kangowh panow lawngha hown kowh thawpah mih kangowh chekhai. Aia kramah mih chak dow naiawngün iüng hown taiah hanow iawnah reng, now ta lat mih dow khawk hown aia thuaah reng chekhai. Nami kaurawng uaramchak dow akeng mih kaurawng uaramchak hown tatu dowi, now anang paw uowi hamüt klüng chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" />Naiawngün nang ang mü reng tak khe naiawngün nang takra hownia achalachow mih nang uang plan awm lowk iawk. Now nami nang sar ria kowi kowh nang prim dow letta pe sum buk khai. Nami achalachow mih nang kowi dow lusa maru kowh mik powm iawng amik uowi chekhai, now tekla bawri lai mih nawr paw uowi lowk chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />“Nami kung kowi dow mang chowm rah chowmta pre sum buk mih ang khi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:9">now Alawngtangma Mih Lowk Ia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Alawngtangma Mih Lowk Ia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Thurai kowi kowh uatah mih chekhai rakowi alung iuk hown ruiah khai. </char></note> dow naiawngün mang chowm rah lowk mih kowi chowm phülü khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Aia kowh tawnguat dow nang iawng akawma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:9">now sam paw lapuk iawng akawma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:9">Aia kowh mang chowm rah hai mang chowm rah lawngkua khawk ün kowi dow maih lün pluplup chekhai,<verse eid="DAN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" />aia pur hownia dow tui talowng phunglung mih iawng maih uang lawt iualua khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Aia kowi dow athawng aiawng kramamu-uüa chang pe lup khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:10">now aia pur kowi dow maru iun tasawng tasawng iowngla rim khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DAN 7:10">Nami kung kowi dow tara chet mih uown khai bowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DAN 7:10">now ming tang bowih mih lowt khai bowt.<verse eid="DAN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />“Ang tang müah reng tak khe nami achalachow mih nang dow chang bawri reng tak chekhai. Nami tali kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak kowi saita dowi mowr ang tang müah khai. Aia kowi saita kung kowi aia kowh uak dow lün pluplup mih maih kowi nawmah khai. <verse eid="DAN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />Now akeng mih kaurawng uaramchak sum buk hownia dow nachang alow kown mih kür pawta pe khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi khowm bowkta pe mih akhin mowr dow pe singah reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" />“Mang lak kowi dow uangnim dawng iawng maru chapa powm iawng uang mih paw ang khi lowk ia khai. Aia dow Alawngtangma Mih Lowk Ia tut-e kowkowi khai, now aia kowi dow nami lawngtang tut-e kowpawla khai. <verse eid="DAN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" />Nami maru chapa kowi dow alow, ringkawra hai mangra peah khai. Naiawng aia kowi peah mih dow palusama kowi kowh chen towng chap towng maru aia kowh lai pacham chün lah pakowh chekhai. Aia kowh mangra dow chowngchowng saksakma; nami dow achur uowi dowi chekhai, now aia kowh pren dow katpaw piak kown nadowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daniel khi-ah mih mang uan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />“Naiawngün ang khita hanow mang lak kowi lainowmma ang tuak krat khai, now ang khita mih lawnguan kowi lainowmma ang kowh saktuak pusa khai. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />Naiawng rakowi mang chowm rah ria kowi kowh iowng miuüa lowk ia tut-e ang kowkowi hanow ang khi-ah mih auan ang kowlünta khai. Nakhowk khe ang khi-ah mih auan dow maiawng aia phuang ang khai: <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />‘Naiawngün aiukma kangowh mih kaurawng uaramchak tali klüng mih dow lusa kowi kowh pren powng mang tali ia chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" />Nachenganchepaw achur kowi dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai maru-uüa naka pren hanow chowngchowng saksakma nakruitown pren büah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />“Nami khin khe akeng mih kaurawng uaramchak lak-e alangma panow kramra uowima mih tali kowi kowh kaurawng uaramchak auan ang lüntaah khai. Nami kaurawng uaramchak kowh iüng dow lawngha hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai, now khawkprüm dow kri hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai. Aia kramah mih chak dow naiawngün iüng hown taiah hanow iawnah reng, now ta lat mih dow khawk hown aia thuaah reng chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />Now nami kaurawng uaramchak kowh anang hamüt klüng mih lawnguan paw ang lüntaah khai. Nami klen kowi achalachow mih nang awr awm lowk now nang prim talet sum buk mih lawnguan paw ang lüntaah khai. Nami nang sar kowi dow amik uowi, now changla bawri mih nawr paw uowi chekhai. Nami dow akeng mih kaurawng uaramchak lak-e iuk chamang lang iuk khai. <verse eid="DAN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" />Nami nang dow Thurai maru-uüa kowi kingküaah hanow senah khai, now nowng sumta khai. <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" />Nachenganchepaw achur kowi dow Thurai maru-uüa kowi nami alawngtangma mih maru tawi tangila se chet pe tara khai. Nami hownia bowt now Thurai maru-uüa mih powng pren khai bowt.<verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />“Nami kung kowi aia dow maiawng phuang ang khai, ‘Tali klüng kowi kowh achur mih kaurawng uaramchak dow lusa tali chowng khe kowh pren powng mang chekhai. Nami mang kowh pren dow akeng mih pren maten lak-e alangma naown kown, now aia dow palusama kowi nathuaah hanow nadita naknak kown. <verse eid="DAN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" />Nami kaurawng uaramchak kowh nang hamüt klüng mih auan dow nami pren kowi mang nauang uowi hamüt ia kown mih chekhai. Naiawngün manguüa kung kowi dow mang narü lowk ia iawk kown. Nami mang dow sum ia mih mang kowi nanowng sumta kown. <verse eid="DAN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" />Nami mang dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowi kingküala mih laiklow natek kown, now Thurai maru-uüa kowi nachang nowng kown. Aia dow khowmta bowkta khowk mih pawi ni hai rirow ün naklingklaita kown mih nakamrüt kown. Aia dow sum ning hown dawnglawng mowr Thurai maru-uüa luk kowi nachang alow kown. <verse eid="DAN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />Nachenganchepaw nami kung kowi dow aia kowi nachet pe tara kown, now aia changla alow mih kür aia kowi napawta pe kown. Now aia kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi asaima napiakta kown. <verse eid="DAN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" />Nami kung kowi dow mangra, alow changra hai lusa pren kowi kowh kür maten lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai maru-uüa rut kowi naap pe bowt kown. Lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowh pren dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi kown. Manguüa maten dow Thurai kowh lup nachang pe kown, now Thurai lai nachün büah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />“Mang kowi kowh ang khi-ah mih dow nami chekhai. Ang Daniel, maiawngün ang krawi tuak hanow lainowmma ang kram khai; ang kowh lumowr khowm müakangma phaw khai. Nachenganchepaw ang kowh mang lawnguan dow mia kowi paw tek pe dowi chekhai, now sak kowi ang matah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s">Ruapurla hai ruala lawnguan kowi kowh mukmang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />Babulawn pren kowi mang Belsazar chowm mang mih sum ning khe ang Daniel mih plan khi mukmang lowk khai. <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" />Nami mukmang kowi ang uowi mih dow Elam pren kowi kowh Susa marow kri kowi chekhai. Nakhowk khe ang uowi mih dow nakowi kowh Ulai aw pang kowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" />Ang krawi tang mü hanow aw paipra pown kowi ruapurla iowng dawnglawng mih ang khi apum. Nami ruapurla kowh dow anang klangma uowi pre buk chekhai. Lowk mih nang dow alowk mih nang kung kowi kowh uang ta awm mih chekhai; nachenganchepaw nami uang ta awm mih nang dow rik awm mih lak-e lang klang chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />Nami ruapurla dow tawngphak, mrawkphak hai satkup pra kowh uowi mih maten kowi krawi tingta bowk khai. Aia pur kowi dow miapaw kownowng iowng dowi chekhai, now aia rut hownia nowng lawng mih paw miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. Aia dow aia nau iawng krawi chang khai, now aia dow uang lang kür ngamlam khai.<verse eid="DAN 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />Nami ruapurla lawnguan kowi ang tuak reng tak khe satkup hownia linlanma ruala uang apum khai. Nami ruala dow kakla krawng dowi kowi lenlenma uang iowm khai. Aia kowh mik takra kowi dow aiukma mih anang uowi lowk chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" />Nami ruala dow kunmarauma hown aw pang kowi iowng dawnglawng mih anang pre buk mih ruapurla prakowi kowiowm khai. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />Nami ruala dow nami ruapurla kowi kowtingah hanow ruapurla kowh nang pre buk mih letta pe khai. Nami ruala pur kowi dow ruapurla mih nowng iowng dowi bowt chekhai; ruala mih ruapurla kowi dow krawng kowi theuah hanow khawk hown thuata naknak khai. Nami ruala hownia ruapurla kowi nowng lawng mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" />Nami ruala dow uang kür ngamlam khai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh kür hu lai bowt khe dow aia kowh nang aiukma mih talet khai, now nami nang talet mih rah hownia nang aiukma uang awr awm tali klüng khai iawk. Naiawngün nang dow pren tali tingnui prakowi krawi tarawk khai. <verse eid="DAN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />Now naiawngün nang tali klüng mih kowi kowh alowk mih nang hownia dow achachow mih nang uang plan awm lowk iawk. Nami nang dow auown khe achachow chowdiah. Tawkchedow akung kowi mih aiukma uang awr phaw hanow satlawt, mrawkphak hai klangiungma mih Israel pren prakowi krawi tarawk khai. <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" />Nami nang dow uang kür ngamlam hanow mukuang siphaiuüa hai krek ün kowi kowsenah khai. Now mukuang siphaiuüa hai krek sangrum kowi dow lusa kowi iu klala hanow aia thuata nak khai. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" />Nami nang dow aiamat kowi mukuang siphaiuüa kowh aluchow lak-e lang iuk padow tanü khai. Nami nang dow mukuang siphaiuüa kowh aluchow vüi ni towng kowh changah mih uanap pawi taingta pe khai, now Thurai chup kim paw sürlawkta pe naknak khai. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mami uan kowi kowh laiklow mih Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai.</char></note> Naiawng angak changra hownia nami nang dow mukuang siphaiuüa luk kowi ka chang alow khai. Now ni towng kowh uanap pawi dow aia vüi kowi pe changah reng khai, now aia dow kawngmu ching kowi kowh rirow mih krawng kowi iu kuakta khai. Aia changah mih srui dow chawn reng chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" />Nami kung kowi dow chimsaima mih kramamu pre ia talawp mih ang ta khai. Lowk ia mih kowi alowk mih kramamu lüntaah mih, “Mami mukmang kowi kowh tüng pe mih sia mün ni mowr chow nauowi kown? Ni towng kowh uanap pawi takcha piakra hai angak chap mün ni mowrchow nauowi tak kown? Thurai chup kim hai mukuang siphaiuüa kowi mün ni mowrchow khawk hown nathuaah kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />Nakhowk khe nami kramamu kowi alowk mih kramamu tek pe mih, “Naiawng nauowi kown mih dow 2,300 ni mowr rau towng hai iak towng chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow Thurai chup kim mih nachimsaiah iawk kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukmang uan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />Now ang Daniel mih nami mukmang lawnguan kowi tatuak thüm khe maru powm iawng ang pur kowi uang iowng lowk ia khai. <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" />Now Ulai aw paipra pown hownia maru lowk ia sangprowk klow ang ta khai. Ang ta mih, “Gabriel, nami mukmang uan nami maru kowi phuang pe dit,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" />Now ang iowng rah re-e Gabriel uang tatawn khe dow ang kram kowh krawng kowi ang tim krum khai. Nakhowk khe Gabriel tek ang mih, “Aw maru chapa, en khi-ah mih mukmang dow khin chur khe kowh lawnguan chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />Aia klang ang mih khin khe ang dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se amawlawma chekhai. Aia dow krüng ang hanow pe iowng ang khai. <verse eid="DAN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" />Aia tek ang mih, “Thurai kunmarau khin uang ting khe tawng iawng chow naown kown mih lawnguan ang natek en kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en khi-ah mih mukmang dow khin chur khe kowh vüi khowm bowkta mih lawnguan chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />“Anang pre buk mih ruapurla dow Media pren hai Persia pren kowi kowh manguüa chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" />Now ruala dow Gris pren chekhai, now amik takra kowi kowh aiukma mih nang dow nami pren kowi kowh rik chowm mang mih mang chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" />Now talet mih nang re-e uang awr awm tali klüng mih nang dow Gris pren hownia pren nauang tabak tali klüng kown mih chekhai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün pren kowi kowh manguüa dow uang rik chowm mang mih mang iawng kür nauowi kown nadowi.<verse eid="DAN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />“Amatni powng pren mih chur prakowi dow lainowmma angak nahu kown. Nami khin khe dow angakma hai kuanlama mih maru nauang chowm mang lowk ia kown. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" />Nami mang dow lainowmma nakür kown. Nachenganchepaw aiamat kür hown nadowi chekhai. Aia dow lainowmma nakrawi piak maru kown, now aia krawi changah mih srui dow nachawn kown. Aia dow akürma mih maru-uüa hai Thurai maru-uüa kowi nakrawi piak kown. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" />Aia dow kuan rak hown nachawn kown, now kowmatia kowi natanü maru iuk kown. Thaulangma maru uowi mih khin khe aia dow nakrawi sen maru kown, now Thurai kowi khowm padow aia mih nakingküa kown. Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow lusa maru kür hown nadowi napiakta kown.<verse eid="DAN 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" />“Now 2,300 ni mowr rau towng hai iak towng kowh uanap lawnguan kowi tüng en mih mukmang dow nauang tachi nowm kown. Nachenganchepaw nami mukmang dow naitah kownkow tukta pe mur diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow pur prakowi khin krama kung kowi kowh nauang tachi kown mih lawnguan chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />Mami mukmang ang khita hanow ang Daniel mih lainowmma bowm khai, now ang kow nga pre sum ni khai. Nami kung kowi dow ang awr rü hanow ang cham chang mang lup khai. Nami mukmang uan ang tuk dowi rakowi lainowmma ang kowh saktuak pusa khai.<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s">Aia maru-uüa vüi Daniel chup Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1-2" />Mami dow Babulawn pren mang Darius uown chowm mang mih ning khe kowh phaw mih lawnguan chekhai. Mang Darius dow Media krungchak Ahasuer kowh chapa chekhai. Mang Darius uown chowm mang mih ning khe ang Daniel mih CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng risi Jeremia ruila mih chabowih ang phat khai. Now nami chabowih hownia dow 70 ning mowr Jerusalem marow napiak kown mih lawnguan ang tuk khai. <verse eid="DAN 9:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />Naiawng rakowi hawm khang hown, sala uan khupma hown hai plawi phawkma hown CHAKRAMANG Thurai tut-e awr lü awr leng khai.<verse eid="DAN 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" />Ang kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tut-e lü lawt se ang chup Thurai mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow kri kraingma hai kramra hown ringkawra uowima mih Thurai chekhai. Sakrau en miuüa hai en laiklow chün miuüa kowi dow en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en napeah kown mih laikham en town pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" />Nachenganchepaw anging dow chang ngak hai tawita mata khai. Anging dow chang lup ngak hai kingküa en khai, now en kowh ana pek hai ari aiang paw anging nuata khai. <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" />Anging kowh manguüa, aluchowuüa, pipu-uüa hai prenchakuüa kowi en nar risiuüa kowi kowh en pe tekah mih laiklow anging sünta dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" />“AW CHAKRAMANG, en dow achinawmma chekhai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat mowr kowi anging dow rukrai rakowi uowi reng tak chekhai. En luk kowi owmsak dowi rakowi Judauüa, Jerusalem marowchakuüa hai Israel maten kowi dow pren towng kowi en cham uetah khai. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging kowh manguüa, aluchowuüa, pipu-uüa hai anging dow rukrai rakowi uowi reng tak chekhai. Nami dow kingküala en mih angak anging chang rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" />Kingküala en mih angak anging chang chepaw en dow saksing sana hai pe lawt reng chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" />CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai laiklow anging chün dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en nar risiuüa kowi en peah mih ana anging chün dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" />Israeluüa maten dow en kowh ana pek chün dowi kowi en kowh tiama hownia lang tahen khai, now amatni dow en klow sünta dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en nar Mosi rirow bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih piati hai tara chet laiklow anging luk kowi uang kla mih chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging dow kingküala en mih angak changta khai. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" />Anging luk kowi phih kraingma en uang pawla anging khai; nami dow anging hai anging kowh kruitown miuüa kowi kingküala mih laiklow en tekta mih nape tachiah kownkow en chang mih chekhai. Jerusalem marow kowi kowh en chang iawng palusama kowi tawng re-e paw en chang dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />Mosi rirow bowih kowi arui uowi iawng maiawngün ripra dow anging luk kowi uang kla mih chekhai. Nachenganchepaw anging dow anging kowh angak hownia uang plan hanow CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai tut-e naka saksing sanara kown mih kowi towk iowh dowi chekhai. Aia kowh anowmma mih prakowi anging pe ching dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" />En dow lup maten mih anowmma en changah reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw en laiklow mih anging chün dowi. Naiawng rakowi aw CHAKRAMANG, naripla anging kownkow en kamrütta hüah mih phih anging luk kowi en nauang pe tingah kown mih mapaw tawi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai, en kowh rut akürma mih hown en maru-uüa kowi Aigupta pren hownia en uang lawtla khai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat pat en kowh aming anang dow iung reng tak chekhai. Nachenganchepaw anging dow chang angak hai chang lup ngak khai. <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow achinawmma chekhai. En kowh chimsaima mih hungh Jerusalem marow kowi kowh en kunmaraura hai en sak-ih dowi mih maten prowngta diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anging hai anging kowh pipu-uüa changta ngak rakowi Jerusalem hai en maru-uüa kowi dow aria aret kowi kowh chenchapuüa changla rensi küakau khai bowt.<verse eid="DAN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" />“Aw anging kowh Thurai, en nar awr lü awr leng mih hawt sünta diah. Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh ming nang nauowila reng kownkow en kowh tapiak khowk mih en kowh chup kim prakowi saksing sanama hown tang mü iawk diah. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, iu sünta diah, now pe ching diah. En kowh mik küah hanow en ming hown kowh hawah mih marow tapiak mih prakowi iu tang mü diah. Naiawng anging awr lü awr leng mih dow anging tachi tanawm mih rakowi nadowi; nami dow en kowh saksing sanara uowi rakowi chowtaih. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, iu sünta diah. Aw CHAKRAMANG, lawt anging diah. Aw CHAKRAMANG pe ching diah, achap dow chang diah. Aw ang kowh Thurai, en kowh ming iung nang iung nauowila reng kownkow hangkow kra tham bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh marow hai en kowh maru-uüa kowi dow en kowh chekhai pami maru tuk khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daniel kowi Gabriel uang klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />Naiawng hai ang awr chup Thurai khai. Ang hai ang chenchap Israeluüa kowh angak dow ang awr taphuang khai. Now CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai tut-e dow aia kowh chimsaima mih hungh naplan ia rawla kownkow ang awr lü awr leng khai. <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" />Naiawng ang chup Thurai reng tak khe mukmang kowi kowh ang khi-ah akat mih chintak mih Gabriel dow iow se ang tut-e uang khai. Aia uang mih dow iak pra kowh phuchua khin khe chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" />Gabriel tek ang mih, “Daniel, kawmat mih natukla kown mih kür hai prengia nauang pe en kownkow ang uang mih chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" />En uown chup Thurai hown akrowksang Thurai dow klang en khai bowt. Nami satang ang naphuang en kownkow ang uang mih chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow lainowmma sakrau en khai. Naiawng rakowi en kowh mukmang uan natukla kownkow sünta kaneu diah.<verse eid="DAN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />“En kowh maru-uüa hai en kowh chimsaima mih marow dow 7 ning chi 70 kat<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">7 ning chi 70 kat </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow 490 ning chekhai.</char></note> mowr amatni kowh angak rakowi naka ripra kownkow Thurai khowm bowkta khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow angak maten narim bowt kown, lup ngak maten nachur bowt kown, now angak paw natakhu bowt kown. Anowm dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi bowt kown, mukmang hai risiuüa phuangta khowk mih laiklow dow nauang tachi bowt kown, now Lang Chimsai Mih Arah dow nanümnapah bowt kown.<verse eid="DAN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" />“En mih mami lawnguan kowi tukah hai tuak kaneu diah. Jerusalem marow naplan raw hai naplan thawp kownkow lawt ana mih hownia kruitown mih Mesia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mesia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami auan dow nümnapah mih pami chekhai.</char></note> uang ting dowi mowr 7 ning chi 7 kat mowr hai 7 ning chi 62 kat mowr naown kown. Jerusalem marow kowi dow tiama hai tap mih naplan thawpah iawk kown. Tawkche nami khin dow lainowmma nakrat kown. <verse eid="DAN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" />Now 7 ning chi 62 kat mowr kung kowi dow Mesia kowi maru nasaita kown. Nahanow aia kowh dow tawngpaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nahanow aia kowh dow tawngpaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami laiklow lawnguan kowi Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai.</char></note>. Nami kung kowi dow kruitown mih narü lowk ia kown, now aia kowh siphaiuüa dow marow hai chimsaima mih arah napiakta bowk kown. Tawkche nami kruitown mih kowh achur khin dow tuikling mangma iawng nauang ting kown. Naiawng hown piakra hai tasenra dow achur khe pat nauowi rengreng kown. <verse eid="DAN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" />Nakhowk khe nami kruitown mih dow ranit ningchow vüi kowi maru sangrum hown natatow sangbowk laitawm kown. Tawkche nami ranit ning takra kowi dow tawncher hai kawmdi uanap mih aia nataingta pe kown. Naiawng krawi piak mih luk kowi kowh khowm bowkta khowk mih ripra uang ting dowi mowr Thurai chup kim kowi dow suiiai kaniaima mih uanh aia natowah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s">Daniel kowi Gabriel uang plan klangah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />Persia pren kowi Kuras chowm mang mih sum ning khe Daniel mih khi mukmang lowk iawk. Nami mukmang auan dow anowmma chekhai, now nami dow lainowmma tukta krat chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Daniel dow sünta kaneu khai, now nami mukmang uan tukta khai. <verse eid="DAN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />Nami khin khe ang Daniel mih sak kowi rau lai kowh sum sapta kar hai nguk hown ang uowi khai. <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" />Nami sum sapta chur dowi mowr tawng iawng mih chaknga iung hai grep tui paw ang cha ang kham dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" />La uown kowi kowh lacher 24 ni mih ni khe dow Taigris awma pang kowi ang iowng khai. <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" />Nami khin khe ang krawi tang mü hanow ang khi maru lowk ia khai. Nami maru dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh tawnguat khupma hai achangma mih kuh kekawm ükma chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" />Aia kowh buk dow asung khakma mih hua iawng, lumowr dow pla nowi iawng, amik dow lün pluplup mih maitawng iawng, now arut akhawk dow süah mih kri iawng tawk pluplup chekhai. Now aia kowh laiklow dow maru kawmma takua talawm khe kowh pawpan klow iawng chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" />Nami mukmang khi mih dow ang Daniel lowk iachow taih chekhai. Ang hown kowh tawi uowi miuüa dow nami mukmang mih tawi khi büah dowi. Tawkche amatni dow lainowmma kram büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow cham powt büah hanow cham tapet khai. <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" />Naiawng rakowi nami akraingma mih mukmang dow ang lowk iachow taih khi khai. Now ang kowh dow tawng iawng mih kür paw uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Ang kowh lumowr dow kowng mih iawng müakangma uang phaw khai, now auaklakma ang own khai. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" />Nami kung kowi dow nami maru kowh laiklow ang ta khai. Aia kowh laiklow ang ta hown krowksang ang maw hanow krawng kowi ang tabawk krawm khai. <verse eid="DAN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />Nakhowk khe mia iawng mih chünchü rut papra hown kak ang hanow krüng ang khai, now chür klukluk se ang awr sawngkrawng hawnglawng khai. <verse eid="DAN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" />Nami maru tek ang mih, “Aw Thurai lang sakrauah mih Daniel, awr rü diah. Ang natek en kown mih laiklow kowi kaneuma pe ching diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en tut-e Thurai uang chin ang mih chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng aia tek ang hanow ang dow chür se ang awr rü khai.<verse eid="DAN 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" />Nakhowk khe aia tek ang mih, “Daniel, hangkow kram diah. Mukmang lawnguan natukla kownkow en chup Thurai hai en kowh Thurai pur kowi en khamsum khamdaw khai. Naiawng en uown chang mih ni hownia en awr lü mih dow mukuang kowi Thurai hawt sünta en khai. Nami en awr lü awr leng mih rakowi ang uang mih chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" />Tawkche Persia pren kowi kowh lang kri mih lümla dow ang naia uangla dowi kownkow 21 ni mowr hang ang khai. Nami khin khe Persia pren manguüa pungmadawng kowi ang lowk iachow taih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Mikael pami kramamu lowk ia dow nauang khowng ang kownkow ang tut-e uang khai, now Mikael kowi dow nakowi Persia pren kowi kowh lang kri mih lümla hown ang ta towla khai. <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" />Ang uang mih dow pur prakowi en maru-uüa luk kowi tawng chow naphaw kown mih lawnguan naphuang en kownkow chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami khin nauang ting kownkow khowmta khowk mih akhin mukmang kowi kowh en khi-ah mih dow kawmat paw uang ting dowi tak chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />Nami maru naiawng tek ang mih khin khe ang dow mum tulu chekhai. Ang dow tawng iawng paw ia lai dowi chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" />Nakhowk khe maru powm iawng mih kramamu kak ang ve khai. Nami hownia now ang ia lai khai bowt. Now aia kowi ang tek pe mih, “Aw ang kowh chakramang, nami mukmang rakowi lainowmma ang sak kawm hai ang kow uak khai bowt. <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />Aw ang kowh chakramang, ang dow en kowh nar chekhai. Naiawng rakowi tawng iawng chow en hown ang nataklangah kown? Ang kowh dow kür uowi dowi bowt, now sak hü paw bowm mih nowm khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />Nakhowk khe maru powm iawng mih kramamu plan kak ang hanow pe ang kür khai. <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" />Aia tek ang mih, “Aw Thurai lang sakrauah mih Daniel, hangkow kram diah. Thaulangma en pacham uowi lah. Sakkraingma hai sakkhawtma uowiah diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 10:19">Now naiawng aia klang ang hown krowksang ang ka kür khai bowt. Aia kowi ang tek pe mih, “Aw ang kowh chakramang, en pe ang kür khowk chedow en nau tek ang kown mih tek ang bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="DAN 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20-21" />Nakhowk khe aia tek ang mih, “Tawng rakowi chow en tut-e ang uang mih en tuk bow? Anowmma Mih Chabowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih laiklow naphuang en kownkow ang uang mih chekhai. Mami kung kowi dow Persia pren kowi kowh lang kri mih lümla kowi nakowsenah kownkow alenma ang nakowplan kown, now ang mang kung kowi dow Gris pren kowi kowh lang kri mih lümla nauang kown. En maru-uüa kowi towkala miuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih Mikael klen kowi dow kowbüah kowi nasen kownkow miapaw uang tawi khowng ang dowi.<verse eid="DAN 10:20-21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />“Media pren kowi Darius uown chowm mang mih ning khe Mikael kowi natawi khowngah kownkow hai natawi peah kür kownkow ang matia paw kowtawi chekhai,” pahai maru powm iawng mih kramamu tek ang khai.<verse eid="DAN 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawngphak hai mrawkphak pra kowh manguüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />Kramamu plan tek ang mih, “Kawmat kowh ang natek en kown mih laiklow dow nauang phaw ngengche kown. Persia pren kowi dow mang sum ia nachowm mang kown. Amatni kung kowi paw mang nauang chowm lowk ia kown. Nami mang dow akeng mih manguüa lak-e nalang kureng kown. Aia dow aia kowh kurengra hown nauang kür ngamlam hanow maru maten kowi kür hown Grisuüa kowi nape senah kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />Nami kung kowi dow Gris pren kowi akürma mih mang nauang uowi lowk ia kown. Aia dow kri kraingma hown nakruitown pren kown, now aia nau iawng nachang kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Aia chowm mang kung kowi dow aia kowh pren mih natapiak nak hanow nachowng tali bak kown. Tawkche aia kowh pren bak dow aia kowh chuprek chaprekuüa natawi ka kown nadowi. Nami pren kowi kowh chowm mang mih dow rik chowm mang miuüa iawng nakür kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh pren dow napiak hanow akeng miuüa kowh nacham chowng kown chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />“Mrawkphak pra kowh pren mang dow akürma naphaw kown. Tawkche aia kowh siphai lowk ia dow aia lak-e nalang kür ngamlam kown. Aia dow pren aiukma nakruitown lowk kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />Pre sum ning kung kowi aia dow tawngphak pra kowh pren mang hown natatow sangbowk laitawm kown. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia kowh chama hown tawngphak pra kowh mang hown nape tachawngah kown. Tawkche achama mih nami sangbowk laitawm naia town pe kown nadowi. Now tawngphak pra kowh pren mang dow namata kür kown. Naiawng rakowi nami masiuüa, nami masiuüa kowh pa hai aia kowh narma narla kowi maru nasaita pe bowk kown.<verse eid="DAN 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />“Nami kung kowi dow nami masiuüa kowh tasin taken miuüa hownia tawngphak pra kowh pren kowi nauang chowm mang lowk ia kown. Nami mang dow tawngphak pra kowh mang siphaiuüa kowi nauang senah hanow kangchawngra kimkrowng akhawtma mih kowi nakowkup kown. Now amatni kowi dow nasenah hanow nanowngta kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />Aia dow amatni kowh thuraiuüa, singh hai hua hown kowh thawpah mih arup aren maten napawta pe kown. Nami klen kowi kuh hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih asung khakma mih uanh ün paw napawta pe bowk kown. Nahanow naiawngün uanh maten dow mrawkphak pra kowh pren kowi aia napawla kown. Now pre sum ning mowr dow tawngphak pra kowh mang kowi aia nauang senah kown nadowi. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Nami kung kowi dow tawngphak pra kowh mang mih mrawkphak pra kowh mang kowi nauang senah kown. Tawkche aia dow sum hanow aia pren kowi nauang plan kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" />Akung kowi tawngphak pra kowh pren mang chapauüa dow nacham dowk tasen kownkow nakamrüt hanow siphai akawmma nakua nalawmah kown, now dowkla tasen se siphai hawmh hown tuikling mangma lawt khe kowh iawng mrawkphak pra kowh mang kangchawngra kimkrowng akhawtma mih mowr nakowkowi büah kown.<verse eid="DAN 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />“Nami khin khe mrawkphak pra kowh mang dow lainowmma nakunmarau hanow tawngphak pra kowh mang kowi nauang dowk tasen kown. Tawngphak pra kowh mang dow siphai akawmma krawi kuala chepaw nasum kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />Mrawkphak pra kowh mang dow tawngphak pra kowh siphaiuüa kowi nowng sumta kung kowi lainowmma nachang bawri kown. Now aia dow athawng aiawng ransu kowi nasaita kown. Nachenganchepaw aia dow chur pat naawng kown nadowi. <verse eid="DAN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />Nami kung kowi tawngphak pra kowh mang dow aia rik kuaah mih siphai hawmh lak-e akawmma naplan kua siphai hawmh iawk kown. Now aia dow pre sum ning kung kowi siphai akawmma hai tasen müa uanh ahuma napawla now nakowtarü kown.<verse eid="DAN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />“Nakhowk khe tawngbak mih maru dow mrawkphak pra kowh mang kowi nakingküaah kown. Mami mukmang nauang tachila kownkow en chenchapuüa pungmadawng hownia sak ngakma mih maru-uüa nakingküaah ne kown; tawkche amatni dow nanowng kown nadowi. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Nami kung kowi dow tawngphak pra kowh mang mih nauangah hanow tap tapat lut mih marow nauang rumta lut kown, now nami marow dow aia napowngta pe kown. Nakhowk khe mrawkphak pra kowh pren siphaiuüa mih tawngphak pra kowh pren kowi nasenah kown nadowi bowt. Amatni kowh tasen lang kiak mih siphaiuüa khowm padow kowbüah kowi naia sen kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" />Tawngphak pra kowh mang dow aia nau iawng amatni kowi nachangah kown. Aia kowi dow amiapaw naia kingküa kown nadowi. Aia dow klangiungma mih Israel pren paw napawta kown, now nami pren mih aia krüa kowi natowah kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />Tawngphak pra kowh mang dow aia pren paprenma kür hown mrawkphak pra kowh mang tut-e nauang kownkow nakamrüt kown. Now aia dow mrawkphak pra kowh mang hown nauang chang auiua kown. Nami pren napiakta kownkow aia dow aia kowh chama kowi mih mrawkphak pra kowh mang hown nape tachawngah kown. Tawkchedow aia kamrütta iawng nachowng kown nadowi, now marat paw namarat kown nadowi. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Nami kung kowi dow tawngphak pra kowh mang mih akeng pren prakowi nape ching kown, now aia dow pren ahuma napowngta kown. Tawkche akeng pren siphai lowk ia dow nami mang kowh bawrira mih napiakta pe kown. Now aia kowh prawng renra dow aia luk kowi nauang pe tingah iawk kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Nami kung kowi aia dow aia kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi nauang plan kown. Nachenganchepaw aia dow ransu-uüa rut kowi nakowng kown; aia kowi dow nakhi-ah kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="DAN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />“Nami kung kowi dow aia takcha kowi mang nauowi lowk ia kown. Nami mang dow pren klangiungra nauang plan pawla iawk kownkow mu kawk miuüa kowi nakrawi chinah kown. Nachenganchepaw aia dow pre sum ning takra kowi nakowng kown. Naiawng aia nakowng kown mih dow kunmaraura hai tasenra hown nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tawngphak pra kowh mang ngak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />“Aia kung kowi kowh nauang ta chowm mang kown mih dow maru ngakma chekhai. Nami maru dow nachowm mang kown mih tataing dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow thaulangma maru uowi mih khin khe limmara hown nakrawi powng pren kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />Aia kowi kowh kingküaah mih akürma mih siphaiuüa dow nasum hanow napiak kown, now lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowh uamow lang kri mih khowm napiak kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />Taking tasangra ki thawp kung kowi nami mang dow nakrawi limma kown. Now aia dow maru tawi tangila pre sum iachow taih chepaw nauang kür ngamlam kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />Kurengma mih prenchakuüa thaulangma pahai tatuak mih khin khe aia dow amatni kowi nakowsenah kown. Now apipu-uüa nowng changah dowi mih ün aia dow nachang kown. Kür hown cham rupah mih uanh hai cham khünah mih dawngthawnguan ün dow aia maru-uüa kowi aia naret pe kown. Aia dow akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün napiakta kownkow nakamrüt kown. Tawkche nami dow pre sum ni chow vüi chowtaih.<verse eid="DAN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />“Aia dow siphai akawmma pawla now aia kowh kür hai sakkraingra mih mrawkphak pra kowh mang kowi natüng pe kown. Nakhowk khe mrawkphak pra kowh mang dow akürma mih siphai hawmh kowi pawla hanow amatni kowi nauang senah kown. Tawkche lowra iawng amatni sangkrang chepaw aia kowi kingküaah huma rakowi tawngphak pra kowh mang tut-e dow nasum büah kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Aia hownia kowh tawi ka chakkham bak miuüa dow aia kowi napiakah kown. Aia kowh siphai hawmh dow napiak kown, now aia kowh siphaiuüa dow ahuma nakowng kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" />Nami mang pre ia kowh saktuak dow angak prakowi kangowh chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi dow arasang taiua chowm chepaw lowkkowlowk nata dai iüah kown. Tawkche naiawngün dai lai hown dow tawngpaw naphaw kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow khowm bowkta mih akhin khe amatni dow bowkbowk napiak kown.<verse eid="DAN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />“Mrawkphak pra kowh mang dow ahuma napawla dawngthawnguan hanow aia pren prakowi namang kown. Aia mang mih khin khe aia dow Thurai maru-uüa kowh kawngmu napiakta kownkow nasangkrang kown.<verse eid="DAN 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />“Aia dow khowmta bowkta mih khin khe mrawkphak pra kowh mang kowi nauang plan senah iawk kown. Tawkche nami leng dow auown khe kowh iawng nadowi kowi alangma naown kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow tasen müa chawnlawng hown aia kowi Kittimuüa nauang sen kown. Nahanow aia kowh sak dow napiak kown. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nakunmarau hanow Thurai maru-uüa kowh kawngmu napiakta kown mih nasangkrang kown. Now Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm nuata miuüa kowi dow aia napeah awmrawm sung kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" />Tawngphak pra kowh mang siphaiuüa dow Thurai chup kim nasürlawkta kown, now ni towng kowh phuchua pawi paw nataingta pe büah kown. Nami kung kowi dow maru tasür talawkla pat mih asür alawkma mih uanh Thurai chup kim kowi natow büah kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />Aia dow chimsaima mih rirow chün dowi miuüa kowi nasowr pe lai iung hanow aiamat prakowi napakla kown. Tawkche tuk Thurai miuüa dow kür hown aia kowi nahangah kown.<verse eid="DAN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" />“Naiawngün maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi chanlai miuüa dow maru kawmuüa kowi natüng nasangah kown. Nachenganchepaw nawngchow vüi kowi amatni pungmadawng hownia nakowng ne kown: Tawngbak mih dow tasenra kowi nakowng ne kown, tawngbak mih kowi dow maih kowi nanawmah kown, tawngbak mih kowi dow thawngrum kowi natowah kown, now tawngbak mih kowi dow narupta pe uanh bowk kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Naiawng nowng chang powng changra uowi mih khin khe naka khowng büah ditchow kown, now amatni hown uang tawi tabawng miuüa dow kowmatia marat müa chowtaih nachang lup kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" />Chanlai miuüa pungmadawng hownia paw tawngbak mih dow nowng chang powng changra kowi nauowi ne kown. Naiawng rakowi khin chur dowi mowr dow Thurai maru-uüa kowi achangma, achinawmma hai anowmma nachangah kown. Thurai khowm bowkta mih akhin uang ting dowi mowr dow naiawng nauowi kown.<verse eid="DAN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />“Tawngphak pra kowh mang dow aiamat nau iawng nachang lup kown. Aia dow akeng thuraiuüa lak-e lang iuk pahai nachang bawri kown, now akeng thuraiuüa kowh Thurai kowi paw kingküala mih laiklow natek kown. Aia luk kowi kowh khowm bowkta mih Thurai kowh kunmaraura uang ting dowi mowr dow aia mih naiawng nachang reng kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />Aia dow aia pipu-uüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi naringkaw kown nadowi, now masiuüa hawmh nauah mih thuraiuüa kowi paw naringkaw kown nadowi. Aia dow tawng iawng mih thurai kowi paw naringkaw kown nadowi. Tawkche maru maten lak-e aia lang kri lang kraing pahai aia mih nachang bawri kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />Aia dow naiawngün thuraiuüa kowi lak-e akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi takhula mih thurai kowi nachupiia kown. Aia dow aia pipu-uüa tukah dowi mih nami thurai kowi kuh, tai, asung khakma mih hua hai awmrawm sung hown naring nakawah kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />Aia dow akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim ün natowkala kownkow akeng thuraiuüa kowi chup mih prenlang maru-uüa natawngah kown. Aia dow aia kowi nami pren kruitown mih ching pahai chün miuüa kowi ringkawra huma napeah kown; amatni kowi dow chowra lup kowi kowh pankrima mih arah kowi aia natowah kown, now aia kowi amatni ringkawah mih rakowi aia krawi powngah mih pren hownia awmrawm sung iawng hown aia nabak pe bawn kown.<verse eid="DAN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />“Khin chur khe dow mrawkphak pra kowh mang mih tawngphak pra kowh mang kowi nauang senah kown. Nahanow nami tawngphak pra kowh mang dow kawrnga kari, kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm mih siphaiuüa hai chawnlawng ahuma uang pawla hanow mrawkphak pra kowh mang kowi uangchak iawng nauang senah kown. Naiawng hai tawngphak pra kowh mang dow pren ahuma nakrawi senla kown, now tuikling mangma iawng amatni kowi dow asaima nanawmta kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" />Aia dow Israel pren klangiungma mih paw nasenla kown. Naiawng hai pren mih ahuma aia napiakta kown. Tawkche Edawmuüa, Moabuüa hai ta lat mih Amawnuüa dow aia rut hownia naplai kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />Aia dow pren maten kowi nakrawi chang alow kown, now Aigupta pren paw aia rut hownia naplai kown nadowi. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />Kuh, tai hai Aigupta pren kowi kowh dawngthawnguan maten dow aia napawta pe bowk kown. Now Libiauüa hai Ethiawpiauüa dow aia nimkrüa kowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />Tawkche aia dow satlawt hai tawngphak hownia kowh satang tata hanow nakram kown. Now aia dow kunmarauma hown nakrawi piak kownkow hai maru kawmuüa kowi nakrawi sai kownkow nalawt kown. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />Now aia dow sata hai Jerusalem marow klangiungma mih hungh chimsaima mih takra kowi nakhup mang tangbung kown. Nachenganchepaw aia dow nakowng kown; aia kowi dow amiapaw nakhowngah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s">Achur khin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />Adipükchow mih la hown kowh tawnguat khupma mih kramamu tek mih, “Khin chur khe dow en maru-uüa kowi hawt towkala reng mih lang kri lang kraing mih kramamu Mikael mih nauang tatüng kown. Nakhowk khe dow krat pusara khin nauang ting kown. Naiawng mih krat pusara dow chenchap maten awr uown uowi hownia katpaw phaw dowi tak chekhai. Tawkche nami khin khe en maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi ming tang bowih kowi ming rui uowi miuüa dow naka lawngra kown. <verse eid="DAN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" />Nakhowk khe dow kowng miuüa akawmma naplan awr sing iawk kown. Tawngbak mih dow achowngma nasing kownkow naawr rü kown, now tawngbak mih dow rukraira hai suiiai kaniaira kowi achowngma nauowi kownkow naawr rü kown. <verse eid="DAN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" />Chanlai miuüa dow mukuang nowi iawng natawk kown. Now aiung tia kowi uang pawla maru miuüa dow krek iawng chowngchowng saksakma natawk pliplip kown. <verse eid="DAN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" />Tawkche aw Daniel, achur khin uang ting dowi mowr dow naiawngün laiklow mih itah diah, now nami chabowih kowi tuk pe mur hanow hing kowpta hüah diah. Nami khin khe dow maru kawmuüa mih naka prengia kownkow nacham krawi mang panglang kown. Nahanow amatni dow naka prengia ngamlam kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />Nakhowk khe ang Daniel mih krawi tang mü hanow ang pur kowi maru iowng pre ia mih ang khi khai. Nami maru pre ia dow aw mapra pown kowi lowk ia, now aw paipra pown kowi lowk ia chekhai. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" />Now aw tui luk kowi kowh uowi mih adipükchow mih la hown kowh tawnguat khupma mih maru kowi lowk ia mih maru lüntaah mih, “Naiawngün awdara lawnguan maten nauang phaw kown mih akhin mün khowt tak chow nalakke kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" />Nakhowk khe aw tui luk kowi kowh uowi mih adipükchow mih la hown kowh tawnguat khupma mih maru dow mukuang prakowi pre rut pre pra awr iaw rut hanow masing Thurai ming hown takham se maiawng awr tek mih ang ta khai. Aia tek mih, “Sum ning hown dawnglang tak nalakke kown. Thurai maru-uüa luk kowi kowh nowng chang powng changra chur khe chiang naiawngün maten nauang phaw kown<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thurai maru-uüa luk kowi kowh nowng chang powng changra chur khe chiang naiawngün maten nauang phaw kown </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami lawnguan kowi Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai.</char></note>,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />Naiawng aia tek mih laiklow dow ang ta chowdiah. Tawkche tawngpaw ang tukta dowi. Naiawng rakowi ang lüntaah mih, “Aw ang kowh chakramang, naiawngün maten tawng iawng chow nachur kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />Nakhowk khe aia klang ang mih, “Aw Daniel, kawmat en namang ngengche kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maiawngün laiklow dow achur khin uang ting dowi mowr naia phuangla dowi kownkow tuk pe mur now towta khai bowt. <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" />Tawngbak mih maru kowi dow Thurai mih achangma, achinawmma hai anowmma nachangah kown. Tawkche maru ngakuüa dow nachang ngak rengreng kown. Maru ngakuüa dow naiawngün lawnguan natuk kown nadowi; chanlaima miuüa ngetchow naiawngün laiklow natukta kown. <verse eid="DAN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" />Ni towng kowh phuchua chang taingta pe mih ni hownia maru tasür talawkla pat mih asür alawkma mih uanh Thurai chup kim kowi uang tow mih ni mowr kowi 1,290 ni naown kown. <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" />Kaah sakowm iawng 1,335 ni mowr town sak se hawt ia chawng mih maru dow prasira uowima chekhai.<verse eid="DAN 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" />“Tawkche kawmat kowh kaah sakowmma en uowi iawng kowng dowi mowr uowiah diah. Akung kowi en nakowng kown; tawkche khin chur khe dow naka awmrawm sung kownkow en naplan sing iawk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>